<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">WEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me angwen pa Moses ma kilwongo Wel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wel</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me angwen pa Moses ma kilwongo</para>
  <para style="mt1">WEL</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Wel tito kit ma jo Icrael pi mwaka ma cokcok pyere angwen guwoto kwede nia ki i got Cinai nio kwede wa tung kunyango me lobo ma Lubanga ocike me miyo botgi. Nying buk man oa ki i gin madit ma otime ikare meno. Man aye kwano wel dano mukwongo ki me aryone ma dok otime inge yalwak me aryo. Kwan mukwongo otime ma peya jo Icrael guweko got Cinai ki me aryo otime ki i Moab i tung kunyango me kulu Jordan. Kwan me aryo otime inge yalwak me acel. I kine me kwano wel dano me acel ki me aryo jo Icrael gucito Kadec-barnea tung kupiny me lobo Kanaan, ento pe gudonyo i lobo ma kiciko pireni ki kunu. I nge bedo kunu pi kare malac, gin gucito kunyango me kulu Jordan, kama jo mukene gunongo kabedo iye ki jo mukene guyube me ngolo kulu Jordan me cito i lobo ma Lubanga ociko pire.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Wel tito kit ma dano gubedo ma cwinygi ongabe angaba dok otur ikare ma gin obedo ka rwate ki peko mapol. Man oweko gin obedo ka jemo ikom Moses, ngat ma Lubanga owiro me telo wigi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man tito kit ma Lubanga gene kwede dok gwoko jone kadi bed gin obedo jo ma ludingo dok lujemo ikome. Moses kono ki tungcel obedo ngat ma tame atir kadi bed kare mukene diyo cwinye oloye woko ikom Lubanga ki ikom jo ma en obedo ka telogi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Jo Icrael guyube me weko got Cinai <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-9:23">1:1—9:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Kwano dano mukwongo <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Cik mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 5:1-8:26">5:1—8:26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Karama me Kato me aryone <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 9:1-23">9:1-23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">A ki iwi got Cinai cito Moab <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 10:1-21:35">10:1—21:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io">Gin mapatpat ma otime i Moab <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-32:42">22:1—32:42</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tito kit ma wot me a ki Ejipt nio Moab obedo kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:1-49">33:1-49</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cik ma ki miyo bot lwak ma peya ki ngolo kulu Jordan <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:50-36:13">33:50—36:13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kwano wel dano mukwongo pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Rwot oloko ki Moses i tim Cinai, i Kema me Rwate, ikom nino dwe mukwongo me dwe me aryo, i mwaka me aryone nicake ki ikare ma dong gua woko ki i lobo Ejipt. Rwot owaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Wun ki Aron wubikwano wel jo Icrael ki bucagi ducu, kun wulubu ki dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi kit ma wel nyinggi tye kwede. Coo nying co ducu kun i kwanogi ki acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo Icrael ducu ma giromo cito kalweny.<verse eid="NUM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Dok wubikwanyo latela acel acel ki i kaka ducu ma bibedo ladit wi kaka ki i ot pa kwarone. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Man aye nying lutela ki odi ma gin a ki iye ma gin bicung ka konyowu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:5">Jo pa Reuben: Elijur wod pa Cedeur. <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Jo pa Cimeon: Celumiel wod pa Juricadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Jo pa Juda: Nakucon wod pa Aminadab. <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Jo pa Icakar: Netanel wod pa Juar. <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Jo pa Jabulon: Eliab wod pa Kelon. <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Jo ma a ki ikin awobe pa Yucepu, jo pa Epraim: Elicama wod pa Amikud, jo pa Manace: Gamaliel wod pa Pedajur. <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Jo pa Benjamin: Abidan wod pa Gideoni. <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Jo pa Dan: Akiejer wod pa Amicadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Jo pa Acer: Pagiel wod pa Okran. <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Jo pa Gad: Eliacap wod pa Deuel. <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Jo pa Naputali: Akira wod pa Enan.” <verse eid="NUM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Man aye gin co ma kiyerogi ki ikin lwak, ma gin aye lutel wi kaka pa kwarigi, gin ludito ma i kaka pa jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Ci Moses ki Aron gukwanyo jo meno ma dong kikwano nyinggi. <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />Ikom nino mukwongo me dwe me aryo gucoko lwak ducu kacel. Gin gucoyo nying wadigi kun gilubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi, cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />kit macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses. Ci Moses okwano dano i tim Cinai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Jo pa Reuben; latin kayo pa Icrael, kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel malubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Reuben oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abicel, ki miya abic.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Jo pa Cimeon; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny; <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Cimeon oromo alip pyere abic wiye abongwen, ki miya adek.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Jo pa Gad; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Gad oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abic, ki miya abicel ki pyere abic.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Jo pa Juda; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Juda oromo alip pyere abiro wiye angwen, ki miya abicel.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Jo pa Icakar; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Icakar oromo alip pyere abic wiye angwen, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Jo pa Jabulon; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Jabulon oromo alip pyere abic wiye abiro, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Jo pa Yucepu; ki tung bot Epraim, kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Epraim oromo alip pyere angwen, ki miya abic. <verse eid="NUM 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Jo pa Manace; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Manace oromo alip pyere adek wiye aryo, ki miya aryo.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Jo pa Benjamin; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Benjamin oromo alip pyere adek wiye abic, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Jo pa Dan; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Dan oromo alip pyere abicel wiye aryo, ki miya abiro.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Jo pa Acer; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Acer oromo alip pyere angwen wiye acel, ki miya abic.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Jo pa Naputali; kikwano wel likwayone kun kicoyo nyinggi ki acel acel ma lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo ducu ma giromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />wel jo ma i kaka pa Naputali oromo alip pyere abic wiye adek, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Meno aye gin jo ma kikwano welgi, mayam Moses ki Aron okwanogi, kun lutel wi Icrael gukonyogi, jo apar wiye aryo, ma ngat acel acel ocung pi ot pa kwarone. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Kitmeno wel jo Icrael ducu ma kikwano kun ki lubu odi pa kwarigi, nia ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere aryo dok kwede malo, jo Icrael ducu maromo cito kalweny, <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />welgi ducu onongo oromo alip miya abicel ki adek, ki miya abic ki pyere abic nono.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiketo jo pa Levi kaloyo kema pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Ento kaka pa Levi pe kikwano welgi ikin kaka mukeneni, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />pien onongo Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Pe ibikwano wel pa Levi ikin jo Icrael maromo cito ka lweny. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Ento ibiketo jo pa Levi bibedo ludito maloyo tic i Kema me Rwate, wek gulo jamine ducu matye iye. Gin aye bitingo kema ki jami matye iye ducu, gibitic iye, dok gibiguru kema me butugi rumu kema pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Ka kare me kobo kema oromo, ci Lulevi aye gibiputune; ki dok Lulevi aye gibigurune. Kace dano mo ata onyiko cok ki kema, ci ki bineke woko. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Jo Icrael gibiguru kemagi ki dog buca monygi, dano acel acel ki dog gonygi, ki dano acel acel ite benderane. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Ento jo pa Levi gibiguru kemagi rumu kema lok me caden, wek akemo pa Rwot pe opot ikom lwak jo Icrael.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Ci jo Icrael gutimo kitmeno, gutiyo gin ducu kit ma onongo Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gony pa kaka acel acel ki lutel wigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Jo Icrael gibiguru kemagi ngat acel acel ite bendera pa kakane, kun giketo ki lanyut me odi pa kwarogi. Ci gibiguru kemagi ki tenge kun doggi kemo Kema me Rwate tungi ki tungi ducu. <verse eid="NUM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Jo ma biguru kemagi tung kunyango, kama ceng tuc ki iyeni, gin bibedo jo ma ite bendera pa Juda, kun gilubu buca monygi. Latel wi jo pa Juda aye Nakucon ma wod pa Aminadab, <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abiro wiye angwen, ki miya abicel. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Jo ma biguru kemagi macok kwede bibedo kaka pa Icakar. Latel wi jo pa Icakar aye Natanel ma wod pa Jura, <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abic wiye angwen ki miya angwen. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Ka dok kaka pa Jabulon; latel wi jo pa Jabulon aye Eliab ma wod pa Kelon, <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abic wiye abiro, ki miya angwen. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Juda, i bucagi, oromo alip miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye abicel, ki miya angwen. Ka wot cake, gin aye gibitelo yoo.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Ki tung kupiny en aye bendera me gony pa jo pa Reuben bicung iye, kun gilubu buca monygi; latel wi jo pa Reuben aye Elijur ma wod pa Cedeur, <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abicel, ki miya abic. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Jo ma biguru kemagi macok kwede bibedo kaka pa Cimeon; latel wi jo pa Cimeon aye Celumiel ma wod pa Juricadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abic wiye abongwen ki miya adek. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Ka dok kaka pa Gad; latel wi jo pa Gad aye Eliacap wod pa Reuel, <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abic, ki miya abicel ki pyere abic. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Reuben, i bucagi, oromo alip miya acel ki pyere abic wiye acel, ki miya angwen ki pyere abic. Ka wot cake, gin aye gibimol me aryone.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Lacen Kema me Rwate bicako wot, kacel ki gony pa jo Levi, i dye gony ducu. Kitma kiguro ki kemagi gibicako wotgi kikore kitmeno, kun dul acel acel tye ki kabedone, kun gilube aluba bendera ki bendera.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Ki tung kupotoceng bendera pa jo Epraim bicung iye, kun gilubu buca monygi; latel wi jo pa Epraim aye Elicama ma wod pa Amikud, <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere angwen, ki miya abic. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Jo ma biguru kemagi macok kwede gibibedo kaka pa Manace; latel wi jo pa Manace aye Gamaliel ma wod pa Pedajur, <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere adek wiye aryo, ki miya aryo. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Ka dok kaka pa Benjamin; latel wi jo pa Benjamin aye Abidan ma wod pa Gideoni, <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere adek wiye abic, ki miya angwen. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Epraim, i bucagi, oromo alip miya acel ki aboro, ki miya acel. Gin bimol me adeke.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Ki tung kumalo bendera pa jo pa Dan bicung iye, kun gilubu buca monygi; latel wi jo pa Dan aye Akiejer ma wod pa Amicadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abicel wiye aryo, ki miya abiro. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Jo ma biguru kemagi macok kwede bibedo kaka pa Acer; latel wi jo pa Acer en aye Pagiel ma wod pa Okran, <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere angwen wiye acel, ki miya abic. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Ka dok kaka pa Naputali; latel wi jo pa Naputali aye Akira ma wod pa Enan, <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />ma kikwano wel dano ma i buca monye oromo alip pyere abic wiye adek, ki miya angwen. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Wel jo ducu ma i gony pa Dan oromo alip miya acel ki pyere abic wiye abiro, ki miya abicel. Gin gibimol me agikine, kun gilube aluba bendera ki bendera.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Meno aye jo Icrael kit ma kikwanogi kwede, kun lubu dog odi pa kwarogi; jo ducu ma i gonygi ma kikwanogi i buca monygi onongo guromo alip miya abicel ki adek, ki miya abic ki pyere abic nono. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Ento jo pa Levi pe kikwano ikom jo Icrael, macalo Rwot onongo ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Jo Icrael yam gutiyo kit macalo Rwot ociko Moses. Guguru kemagi kitmeno ite benderagi, gucako wot bene gumol kitmeno, ngat acel acel ki dogolane, macalo dog odi pa kwarigi tye kwede.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Awobe pa Aron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Man aye likwayo pa Aron ki Moses ikare ma Rwot obedo kalok ki Moses iwi got me Cinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:60">Wel 26:60</ref></char></note>Magi aye nying awobe pa Aron: Nadab latin kayone ki Abiu, Eleajar ki Itamar; <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />meno aye nying awobe pa Aron, gin aye ajwaki ma ki wirogi ki moo, ma Moses yam okwerogi pi tiyo tic me bedo ajwaki. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:61">Wel 26:61</ref></char></note>Ento Nadab ki Abiu gin oto inyim Rwot ikare ma gutyero mac mapat inyim Rwot i tim Cinai. Gin gubedo peke ki lutino. Ma omiyo Eleajar ki Itamar gutiyo tic pa ajwaki ikare ma won gi pud kwo.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Kel kaka pa Levi cok, ci iketgi inyim ajwaka pa Lubanga wek guti bote. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Gin bitiyo tic pire ki pi lwak ducu inyim Kema me Rwate, dok gibitiyo tic pi jo Icrael kun gitiyo ticgi i Kema. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Gin aye gibigwoko jami ducu ma i Kema me Rwate, dok gibitiyo tic pi jo Icrael kun gitiyo ticgi i Kema. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Ibimiyo Lulevi bot Aron ki awobene; pien tic ma ki miyo botgi matwal eno. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Ci ibiketo Aron ki awobene, me tiyo ticgi me bedo ajwaki; ento ka ngat mo mukene mapat ki awobe pa Aron onyiko cok i Kema katiyo meno, kibineke woko.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Ci Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Nia 13:2</ref></char></note>“Nen, dong atyeko kwanyo jo pa Levi ki ikin jo Icrael ma ka lutino kayo ducu mukwongo yabo ic ikin jo Icrael. Jo pa Levi aye gibibedo jona, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />pien lutino kayo ducu mera. Inino mayam aneko iye lutino kayo ducu ma i lobo Ejipt ca, en aye akwero iye lutino kayo ducu ma i Icrael gubed mera, pa dano ki pa lee; gibibedo mera; An a Rwot.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ki i tim Cinai ni, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Kwan wel likwayo pa Levi, kun ilubu dog odi pa kwarigi, ki dogolagi; ibikwano co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Kitmeno Moses okwano welgi kit ma Rwot owaconi, macalo yam ocike kwedeni. <verse eid="NUM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Magi aye awobe pa Levi ma kiyeko nyinggi: Gercon, Kokat ki Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Magi aye nying awobe pa Gercon kun lubu dogolagi: Libni ki Cimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Awobe pa Kokat kun lubu dogolagi gin aye: Amram, Ijar, Kebron ki Ujiel. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Awobe pa Merari kun lubu dogolagi gin aye: Makali ki Muci. Meno aye dogola pa Lulevi, kun lubu dog odi pa kwarigi.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Jo pa Gercon aye dogola pa jo pa Libni ki dogola pa jo pa Cimei; meno aye dogola pa jo pa Gercon. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Welgi ma kikwano wel co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo oromo alip abiro, ki miya abic. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Dogola pa jo pa Gercon yam guguru kemagi i nge kema tung kupotoceng, <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />kun Eliacap wod pa Lael obedo ladit ki i ot pa kwaro pa jo Gercon. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Tic pa likwayo pa Gercon i Kema me Rwate obedo me gwoko kema; en aye kema kikome ki laum wiye, bongo cuka laum dogola me dogola Kema me Rwate, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />bongo cuka me angaba me larum dyekal, bongo cuka laum dogola me dyekal ma orumu kema ki keno tyer, ki lwak tol lacikgi; dog tic ducu ma mite pi jami magi.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Jo pa Kokat aye dogola pa jo pa Amram, ki dogola pa jo pa Ijar, ki dogola pa jo pa Kebron, ki dogola pa jo pa Ujiel; meno aye dogola pa jo pa Kokat. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Welgi ma kikwano wel co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo oromo alip aboro, ki miya abicel ma gitiyo ticgi i Kabedo Maleng. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Dogola pa jo pa Kokat yam giguru kemagi inget Kema tung kupiny, <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />kun Elijapan wod pa Ujiel obedo ladit ki i ot pa kwaro me dogola pa jo pa Kokat. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Ticgi obedo me gwoko canduk, meja, lacib mac, keno tyer, jami me Kabedo Maleng ma ajwaki gitiyo kwedgi ducu, ki bongo kicika; i dog tic ducu ma mite pi jami magi. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Ladit maloyo ludito ducu pa Lulevi obedo Eleajar wod pa ajwaka Aron. En onongo loyo jo ma gitiyo ticgi i Kabedo Maleng.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Jo pa Merari aye dogola pa jo pa Makali ki dogola pa jo pa Muci; meno aye dogola pa jo pa Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Welgi ma kikwano wel co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo oromo alip abicel, ki miya aryo. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Ladit wi ot pa kwarogi ma i dogola pa jo Merari obedo Juriel wod pa Abikail. Gin yam giguru kemagi inget Kema tung kumalo. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Tic ma kimiyo bot likwayo pa Merari obedo me gwoko lwak guti me kema, riine, wire, lwak tedi tere ki gin ducu ma okemo tice; i dog tic ducu ma mite pi jami magi ducu. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Ka dok lwak wir ducu ma gurumu dyekal, tedi tergi, teke lagurgi, ki lwak tole.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Jo mayam guguru kemagi inyim kema tung kunyango, inyim Kema me Rwate tung kama ceng tuc ki iyeni, gin aye Moses ki Aron ki awobe pa Aron. Gin onongo kityeko ketogi i dog tic ma i Kabedo Maleng, pi tiyo tic ducu ma mite pi jo Icrael; ka ngat mo mukene onyiko cok, omyero kinek woko. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Wel jo Levi ducu mayam Moses ki Aron gukwano, welgi pi lubu cik pa Rwot, kun lubu dogolagi, co ducu cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo, oromo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lulevi guleyo kaka lutino kayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Lutino kayo ducu ma co ki ikin jo Icrael, ducu mera. Coo nyinggi piny, cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Ibikwanyo jo pa Levi gubed mera ma ka lutino kayo ducu ma ikin jo Icrael. Dok iter lim makwo pa jo Levi ma ka lutino kayo lim ducu ma ikin lim makwo pa jo Icrael. An a Rwot!” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Kitmeno Moses okwano wel lutino kayo ma ikin jo Icrael ducu, macalo Rwot ocike. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Lutino kayo ducu ma co, macalo wel nyinggi tye, cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo, ka kikwano welgi onongo guromo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki miya aryo ki pyere abiro wiye adek.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Kwany jo pa Levi gubed ma ka lutino kayo ducu ma ikin jo Icrael, dok iter lim makwo pa jo Levi ma ka leegi; pien jo pa Levi gibibedo jona. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Pi koko lutino kayo miya aryo ki pyere abiro wiye adek ma ikin jo Icrael ma gudong ma wel pa jo pa Levi orem woko pirgi ni, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />ibigamo cekel abicabic pi dano acel acel; ibigamo kun ilubu wel cekel ma kimoko. Ma cekel acel romo gera pyere aryo nono <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Lim meno ma kikoko kwede wel jo ma gudongi ibimiyo bot Aron ki awobene.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ma omiyo Moses ogamo lim me kok ki bot jo ma odong ma wel pa jo Levi orem me kokogi. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />Moses ogamo lim ryal ki bot lutino kayo pa jo Icrael maromo cekel alip acel, ki miya adek ki pyere abicel wiye abic, kun lubu wel cekel ma kimoko. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Moses omiyo lim meno me kok bot Aron ki awobene, kit ma Rwot owaconi, macalo Rwot yam ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Lulevi ma i kaka pa Kokat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Kwan wel likwayo pa Kokat ma ikin likwayo pa Levi, kun ilubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere adek nio wa ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic pi tiyo tic ma i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Man aye tic ma likwayo pa Kokat gibitiyo i Kema me Rwate: gin bitic ikom jami maleng makato. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Ka gony dong bicako wot, ci Aron ki awobene bidonyo i Kema ka kwanyo bongo kicika, ci kiumu kwede Canduk lok me Caden. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Ka dok gibiumu wiye ki laa dyel, lacen gibiyaro bongo ma bulu ikom meno, ka dong gibirwako tale iye. <verse eid="NUM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />Gin bipeto bongo ma bulu ikom meja me keto mugati ma kiketo inyim Rwot, ka dong gibiketo caani iwiye, ki atabo me odok eceta, ki wee, ki cupa me onyo gityer amata; mugati ma kicano inyim Rwot jwijwi bene obed iwiye. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Lacen gin biyaro bongo makwar iwiye, ci meno gin biumu ki laa dyel laume, ka dong gibirwako tale iye. <verse eid="NUM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />Ka dok gibikwanyo bongo ma bulu, ci kiumu ki lacib mac, kacel ki lapute, ki magace, ki caanine ki atabo moone ducu ma gitiyo kwede tice. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Ci gin biboyo en ki jami tice ducu ki laa dyel laume, ka dong gin bipyelo iwi tal latinge.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />Ci gin biyaro bongo ma bulu ikom keno tyer me jabu, ka dok gin biumu kome ki gin ma kikwoyo ki laa dyel, ka dong gin birwako tale iye. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Gin bikwanyo jami tic ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi i Kabedo Maleng, gin biboyogi ducu ki bongo ma bulu, ka dong gin biumugi ki gin ma kikwoyo ki laa dyel, ci gin bipyelo iwi tal latinge. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Gin bijobo buru mac ma i keno me tyer woko, ci gin biyaro bongo ma lamarlamar iwiye; <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />ka dok gibiketo iye jami tic ducu me keno tyer, ma kitiyo kwede tic ikome; wee lawang mac, gin lacob ringo, akwaya latoke ki becen, jami tic ducu me keno tyer; ka dok gibiyaro ikome laa dyel laume, lacen gibirwako tale. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Ka Aron ki awobene dong gutyeko umu Kabedo Maleng ki jami ma i Kabedo Maleng ducu ikare ma guputu gony, lacen likwayo pa Kokat dong gibibino ka tingo jami me Kema, ento pe gugud kom jami maleng ducu, wek pe guto. Magi aye jami me Kema me Rwate ma likwayo pa Kokat bitingo.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Eleajar wod pa Aron aye biloyo moo tara, ki odok ma ngwece kur, ki gityer me moko kwon me nino ducu, ki moo wir, kun dok loyo kom Kema ducu ki lwak jami ducu ma bedo iye, en aye Kabedo Maleng kikome ki jami tice.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Pe iwek dogola ducu me kaka pa jo pa Kokat guto gutum woko ki ikin jo pa Levi, <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />ento ber i ti kwedgi kitmeno wek gubed makwo, ma pe guto ikare ma gibino cok ki jami maleng makato ducu. Aron ki awobene aye bidonyo ka nyutugi tic pa ngat acel acel ki yec ma gin bitingo. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Ento gin pe bidonyo i iye kaneno kom jami maleng kadi matidi mo, wek pe guto.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Kwan wel likwayo pa Gercon bene, kun ilubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi; <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />ibikwano welgi cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere adek nio wa ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic pi tiyo tic ikom Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Man en aye dog tic ma dogola pa Gercon ducu gibitiyo, me tiyo tic ki me tingo yec: <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />gin bitingo bongo cuka me kema, ki Kema me Rwate ki laum wiye, ki laa dyel ma kiumu kwede wiye malo, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />ki bongo cuka me angaba me rumu dyekal, ki bongo laum dog gang me dyekal ma orumu kema ki keno tyer, ki lwak tol lacikgi, ki jami tic ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi iye; gibitiyo tic ducu ma mite ikom jami magi. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Tic ducu ma likwayo pa Gercon gibitiyo bibedo kit ma Aron ki awobene gibicikogi kwede; dok gin aye bipoko yecgi ducu botgi me agwoka. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Man en aye tic pa ludogola weng pa likwayo pa Gercon ducu ki i Kema me Rwate; dog ticgi bibedo ite loc pa Itamar wod pa ajwaka Aron.”<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tic pa likwayo pa Merari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Likwayo pa Merari ibikwano welgi kun ilubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi; <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />ibikwano welgi cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere adek nio wa ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Magi aye gin ma kimiyo botgi me atinga, ma en aye ticgi ducu ki i Kema me Rwate: lwak guti me Kema, riine, wire ki lwak tedi tere, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />ki wir ducu ma orumu dyekal, tedi tergi ducu, teke lagurgi ki tol lacikgi, jami ticgi ducu ki gin ma okemo tic ducu. Ibipoko botgi jami ma kimito ni guting kun inyutu ki nyinggi. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Man aye tic pa ludogola weng pa likwayo pa Merari ducu, i dog ticgi ducu i Kema me Rwate; ma bibedo ite loc pa Itamar wod pa ajwaka Aron.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Moses ki Aron ki lutel wi lwak gukwano wel likwayo pa Kokat, kun lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />cake ki ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere adek nio wa ikom jo ma mwakagi romo pyere abic. Jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic, pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Welgi ma kikwano kun lubu dogolagi oromo alip aryo, ki miya abiro ki pyere abic. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Meno aye wel dogola weng pa jo pa Kokat, jo ducu ma gutiyo tic i Kema me Rwate, ma Moses ki Aron gukwano welgi, macalo Rwot ociko kun wok ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Man wel likwayo pa Gercon ma kikwano welgi kun lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />cake ki jo ma mwakagi romo pyere adek nio wa jo ma mwakagi romo pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic, pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />Welgi ma kikwano kun lubu dogolagi oromo alip aryo, ki miya abicel ki pyere adek. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Meno aye wel dogola weng pa likwayo pa Gercon, jo ducu ma gutiyo tic i Kema me Rwate, ma Moses ki Aron gukwano welgi, macalo Rwot ociko kun wok ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Man aye wel likwayo pa Merari ma kikwano welgi kun lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarogi. <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />Cake ki jo ma mwakagi romo pyere adek nio wa jo ma mwakagi romo pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic, pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />Welgi ma kikwano kun lubu dogolagi oromo alip adek, ki miya aryo. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Meno aye jo me dogola pa likwayo pa Merari ma kikwanogi, ma Moses ki Aron gukwano welgi, macalo Rwot ociko kun wok ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Jo ducu ki ikin jo pa Levi ma kikwano welgi, ma Moses ki Aron ki lutel wi Icrael gukwanogi kun lubu dogolagi ki dog odi pa kwarigi, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />cake ki jo ma mwakagi romo pyere adek nio wa jo ma mwakagi romo pyere abic, jo ducu ma giromo donyo i dog tic pi tiyo tic mapatpat ki pi tingo yec i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />Jo ma ikin gi ma kikwano welgi guromo alip aboro, ki miya abic ki pyere aboro. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Macalo Rwot yam ociko kun wok ki i dog Moses ci ki miyogi ticgi kitmeno, ngat acel acel i dog tice me tiyo tic nyo me tingo yec; kikwano welgi kitmeno, macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma komgi ki keni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Cik jo Icrael gucwal jo ducu ma twoyo two delkom gua woko ki igony, ki dano acel acel ma kome cwer tut, ki dano acel acel ma odoko keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Wubicwalo co wa ki mon bene, kun wucwalogi woko ki igony, wek pe gubal gony ma an abedo iyeni, ikin jona.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Jo Icrael gutimo kitmeno, ci gucwalogi woko i nge gony; macalo Rwot con owaco bot Moses.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako culu wang jami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 6:1-7">Lev 6:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Wac ki jo Icrael ni: ‘Kace laco mo nyo dako mo otimo bal mo ma dano timo kun gingayo wang Rwot, ce otingo alii, <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />ci en bitucu bal mere ma otimo ni; ka dok en biculu wang gin marac ma otimo; bimedo iye acel me abic, ci miyo bot dano ma en otimo maraci. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Ento ka dano meno wate mo peke ma omyero kicul wang gin maraci bote, lacul wang gin marac meno bedo pa Rwot, kibiculune bot ajwaka pa Lubanga, kun kibamo iye nyok romo me kwanyo bal ma kitimo kwede gin lakwany bali ki ikome. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Gityer ducu, nyo jami ducu maleng pa jo Icrael ma kikelo bot ajwaka pa Lubanga bibedo mere. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Jami maleng ma dano acel acel okelo bibedo pa ajwaka pa Lubanga; gin ducu ma dano mo omiyo bot ajwaka pa Lubanga bibedo pa ajwaka pa Lubanga.’”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako dako ma cwiny cware gung ikome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />“Wac ki jo Icrael ni, ka laco mo cwinye gung ikom dakone kun tamoni dakone tye katimo abor, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />ma oweko laco mo obutu kwede, ce cware pe ongeyo, ma dako ojere kekene kun loke okane woko, dok pe tye caden mo ma moko lok kom dako meno, pien pe kinonge iye; <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />ka cwiny me nyeko omako laco, ma nyeko omake ikom dakone ma ojere kekeneni, nyo ka cwiny me nyeko omako laco, kun nyeko omake ikom dakone, kadi bed dako pe otimo abor mo keken, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />ci laco bitero dakone bot ajwaka pa Lubanga, kun tero gityer ma ki mito pi dakone, agwata moko kwon acel me moko cayiri; pe bionyo moo ikome, pe biketo iye odok luban, pien meno gityer me moko kwon me nyeko, en gityer me moko kwon me lapowic, ma bimiyo kipo pi bal meno.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />Ci Ajwaka pa Lubanga bikelo dakonu cok, ci cibo inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Ka dok ajwaka pa Lubanga bitero pii maleng ki otako, ci jobo apwa ma i dye ot me Kema, onyo i pii. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Ka ajwaka pa Lubanga bicibo dako inyim Rwot, ci bigonyo yer wi dakonu wek oket ata lijayi, ci keto gityer me moko kwon me lapowic i cinge, ma en aye gityer me moko kwon me nyeko. Ci Ajwaka pa Lubanga bimako pii makec me ceno dano i cinge. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Ka ajwaka pa Lubanga bimiyo dako meno kwongo kwong, kun waco ni, ‘Ka laco mo pe obutu kwedi, ka pe ingak woko, kun ijere kekeni ma kun itye ite twero pa cwari, ci gin marac mo pe otimi pi pii man makec me ceno danoni. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Ento kace wangi odoko tar, ma kun pud itye ite twero pa cwari, ma ijere kekeni, ma laco mo ma pe cwari obutu kwedi, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />ci ajwaka pa Lubanga bimiyo dako meno kwongo kwong makelo ceno dano kun waco ki dako meno ni, Rwot omii in idok ngat ma kiceno ki ikin dano, kun nyingi odok ongon ikin lutuwu, ikare ma Rwot bitweyo ot nyodoni woko dok bimiyo ii bene deng woko; <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />wek pii man me ceno dano ocit i cin ii, omii ii odeng, ci otwe ot nyodoni woko.’ Ci dakonu bigamo ni, ‘Amen, Amen.’<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />Lacen ajwaka pa Lubanga bicoyo lok me ceno dano ni ikaratac, ka dok lwoko coc woko ki pii makeci, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />ci bimiyo dako meno mato pii makec ma kiceno ki danoni, ci pii me ceno dano bidonyo i iye, miyo iye mwode matek. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Ka dok ajwaka pa Lubanga bikwanyo gityer me moko kwon me nyeko woko ki i cing dako meno, ci kwato gityer me moko kwon inyim Rwot, tero ikeno tyer. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Ka ajwaka pa Lubanga bijobo moko me gityer pong cing acel obed gin me po ikome, ci biwango iwi keno tyer; ka dok lacen en bimiyo dako meno mato pii. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Ka dong omiyo omato pii, kace onongo en otyeko jere kekene kun otimo abor, ci pii me ceno dano bidonyo i iye, miyo iye mwode matek; iye bideng woko, ot nyodone bitwene woko, ci nying dakoni bidoko ongon ikin lutugi. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Ento ka dako meno pe ojere kekene, ma bal mo pe ikome, ci gin mo marac pe bitime ikome, ci en binywalo lutino.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />Man aye cik ma mako lok me nyeko, ka dako matye ite twero pa cware ma nongo wange tar, ci ojere kekene, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />nyo ka cwiny me nyeko omako laco mo, kun cwinye gung ikom dakone; en bicibo dako inyim Rwot, ci ajwaka pa Lubanga bitic ikom dako kun lubu cik man ducu. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Laco pe bibedo ki bal mo, ento bal bidok iwi dako ka obalo.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako ngat ma odyere bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka laco mo nyo dako mo okwongo kwong ma pire tek, kwong me bedo latic pa Lubanga, ci nongo en okone gire kene pi bedo dano pa Rwot.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dano meno kilwongo ni ajula pa Lubanga, i leb Ibru kilwongo ni Najir.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:15">Luk 1:15</ref></char></note>Dano meno bikone gire kene kun pe mato kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano. En pe bimato kongo mawac ma oa ikom bwino nyo gin mo ma mero dano. En bene pe bimato pig nyig olok, kadi camo nyige madyak nyo mutwone. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Ikare ducu ma en okone iye gire kene, pe bicamo gin mo ma oa ikom olok, kadi nyige matino ma i iye, wa odune.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />Ikare ducu ma nongo en okwongo pire ni ebikone gire kene, lyedi pe bigudu wiye; en bibedo dano maleng nio wa ikare ma karene me kone pi bedo dano pa Rwot dong otum; ci biweko yer wiye lot maboco ma pe kilyelo.<verse eid="NUM 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Ikare ma en okone iye gire kene pi bedo dano pa Rwot, pe binyiko cok ikom dano ma oto. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />En pe bibale doko keni kadi pi wone nyo mine, nyo omine, nyo lamine kace guto, pien gin ma nyutu konene kene pi bedo dano pa Lubanga pud tye iwiye. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Ikare ducu me konene kene en bibedo maleng pi Rwot.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />Ka dano mo oto atura kangete, ma weko wiye ma okweroni doko keni, ci en bilyelo wiye inino me lonyene; bilyelo inino me abirone. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Ikom nino me aborone en bitero amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo bot ajwaka pa Lubanga i dogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Ajwaka pa Lubanga bityero acel pi gitum me bal ki acel pi gitum awanga, kun timo gin lakwany bal ki dano meno, pien onongo obalo pi gudu kom dano ma oto. En bikwero wiye inino meno kikome, <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />ci bikone gire pi bedo dano pa Rwot pi karene me kone kene, dok bikelo wod romo madite tye mwaka acel wek obed gitum me tingo alii; ento kare mukwongo ca nongo obale nono, pien yer wiye ma okweroni odoko keni.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />Man aye cik ma mako dano ma odyere bot Lubanga ka karene me kone kene dong otum. Kibikele i dogola Kema me Rwate, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />ci en bityero mote bot Rwot, bityero wod romo acel me mwaka acel, ma kome pe kimwonyo, pi gitum awanga, ki bwong romo acel madite tye mwaka acel ma kome pe kimwonyo pi gityer me berbedo, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />kacel ki aduku me mugati ma tobi peke iye, capat me moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo, ki capat marep ma tobi pe iye ma kireyo moo ikomgi, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otikogi.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />Ajwaka pa Lubanga bikelo gityer magi inyim Rwot, ci tyero gitum me bale ki gitum me tingo alii. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Ka dok bityero nyok romo obed gityer me berbedo bot Rwot, kacel ki aduku mugati ma tobi pe iye. Ka dok ajwaka pa Lubanga bityero gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Dano ma odyere bot Lubanga bilyelo yer wiye me kone kene i dogola Kema me Rwate, ci bikwanyo yer wiye me dyereni, keto imac matye ite gityer me berbedoni. <verse eid="NUM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />Ajwaka pa Lubanga bikwanyo bat nyok romo ka dong kitedo, ki capat acel ma tobi peke iye, ki i aduku, ki capat marep acel ma tobi peke iye, biketogi i dye cing ngat ma odyere, ka dong olyelo yer wiye me kone keneni. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Ajwaka pa Lubanga bikwatogi me bedo gityer me akwata inyim Rwot; gin aye wang wat maleng pa ajwaka pa Lubanga, kacel ki gok ma kikwatoni ki em ma kityero; lacen dano ma odyereni dong twero mato kongo bwino.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />Man aye cik ma mako dano ma odyere ma okwongo kwong. Gityere bot Rwot bibedo ma oporo kwonge ma okwongo me bedo latic pa Lubanga, ma en miyo kacel ki gin ma en romo nongone, wek en otii ma oporo kwong mayam okwongo, kun lubu cik ma mako konene kene me bedo ngat ma odyere.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lamo gum pa Ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Wac bot Aron ki awobene ni, Wubilamo gum ikom jo Icrael kit man:<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />Rwot omini gum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 6:24">ogwoki;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Rwot oneni ki wang me kica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 6:25">otimi ber;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Rwot oneni dok omini kuc.<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />Ci Rwot owaco ni ka Aron ki awobene bitucu nyinga pi miyo gum ikom jo Icrael kitmeno, ci an abimiyogi gum.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Tyer pa Lutela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Ka Moses otyeko guru kema, ci owiro ki moo ka dong okwero kacel ki jami ma i iye ducu. Ka dok owiro keno tyer ki moo bene, okwero kacel ki jami tice ducu. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Ikare meno rwodi, ma gin ludito wi kaka ki i Icrael, lutel wi kaka mayam guloyo kwano wel dano, <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />gutyero gityer ma meggi inyim Rwot. Gumiyo gadigadi abicel ma gitye ki gin umu wigi, ki twoni apar wiye aryo; lutel wic aryoaryo gumiyo gadigadi acel acel, ci ngat acel acel omiyo twon acel; gutyerogi ki inyim kema. <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Rwot dok owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Gam mot magi ducu ki botgi wek kitii kwedgi tic ma i Kema me Rwate, ci imigi bot Lulevi, macalo dog tic pa ngat acel acel tye kwede.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ci Moses ogamo gadigadi ducu ki twoni, ci omiyogi bot Lulevi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Gadigadi aryo ki twoni angwen omiyo bot likwayo pa Gercon, ma oporo dog ticgi. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Ka dok gadigadi angwen ki twoni aboro omiyo bot likwayo pa Merari, ma oporo dog ticgi, kun gitye ite loc pa Itamar wod pa ajwaka Aron. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Ento pe omiyo gin mo bot likwayo pa Kokat, pien yam kiketogi i dog tic me gwoko jami maleng ki me tingogi iwi gwokgi. <verse eid="NUM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Ci lutel wic gutyero gityer me kwero keno tyer nino meno ma ki wiro iye ki mooni. Lutel wic gutyero gityergi inyim keno tyer. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Lutela bityero gityergi kun latel wic acel acel tyero mere i ninone, pi kwero keno me tyer.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Ngat ma otyero gityere inino mukwongo en aye Nakucon wod pa Aminadab, ma i kaka pa Juda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye ki mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Nakucon wod pa Aminadab otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Inino me aryone Netanel wod pa Juar, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Icakar otyero tyer ma mege. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />En otyere caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko; gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel madite romo mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />Ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Netanel wod pa Juar otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Inino me adeke obedo nino pa Eliab wod pa Kelon, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Jabulon. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel madite tye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Eliab wod pa Kelon otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Inino me angwene obedo nino pa Elijur wod pa Cedeur, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Reuben. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Elijur wod pa Cedeur otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Inino me abice obedo nino pa Celumiel wod pa Juricadai, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Cimeon. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye gityer ma Celumiel wod pa Juricadai otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Inino me abicele obedo nino pa Eliacap wod pa Deuel, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Gad. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Eliacap wod pa Deuel otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Inino me abirone obedo nino pa Elicama wod pa Amikud, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Epraim. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon, <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Elicama wod pa Amikud otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Inino me aborone obedo nino pa Gamaliel wod pa Pedajur, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Manace. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye ki mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Gamaliel wod pa Pedajur otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Inino me abongwene obedo nino pa Abidan wod pa Gideoni, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Benjamin. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal acel ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />Ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Abidan wod pa Gideoni otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Inino me apar obedo nino pa Akiejer wod pa Amicadai, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Dan. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />Ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Akiejer wod pa Amicadai otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Inino me apar wiye acel obedo nino pa Pagiel wod pa Okran, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Acer. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi tyer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal; <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Pagiel wod pa Okran otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Inino me apar wiye aryo obedo nino pa Akira wod pa Enan, ma en aye latel wi jo pa Naputali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />En otyero caani me ryal acel ma peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen me ryal ma peke cekel pyere abiro, ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. Gin aryo ducu igi opong ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />Ka dok atabo me jabu acel ma peke cekel apar ma opong ki odok eceta. <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />Wod twon acel, nyok romo acel, ki wod romo acel matye mwaka acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />Nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />Ka dok pi tyer me berbedo otyero twoni aryo, nyogi romi abic, nyogi dyegi abic, ki lutino nyogi romi abic ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel. Man aye tyer ma Akira wod pa Enan otyero.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Man aye obedo tyer me kwero keno tyer, ma kityero nino ma kiwiro iye ki moo, ma oa ki bot lutel wi Icrael: caani me ryal apar wiye aryo, becen me ryal apar wiye aryo, ki atabo me jabu apar wiye aryo, <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />kun nongo caani me ryal acel acel peke romo cekel miya acel ki pyere adek, ki becen acel acel peke romo cekel pyere abiro, ma omiyo ryal me jami ducu pekgi oromo cekel alip aryo, ki miya angwen ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Atabo me jabu onongo tye apar wiye aryo, ma odok eceta opongo igi, kun atabo acel acel peke romo cekel apar ka kiporo ki wel ma kimoko, ma omiyo jabu me atabo ducu oromo cekel miya acel ki pyere aryo. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Lee makwo ducu pi gitum awanga giromo twoni apar wiye aryo, nyogi romi apar wiye aryo, ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye aryo ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel, kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ma otikogi; ki nyogi dyegi apar wiye aryo pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Lee makwo ducu pi tyer me berbedo gubedo twoni pyere aryo wiye angwen, nyogi romi pyere abicel, nyogi dyegi pyere abicel, ki lutino nyogi romi ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel pyere abicel. Meno aye obedo tyer me kwero keno tyer, ma kityero ma dong kityeko wirone ki moo.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Ikare ma Moses ocito i Kema me Rwate kalok iye ki Rwot, owinyo dwon Rwot ka tye kalok kwede kun a ki malo iwi kom me kica ma iwi Canduk lok me Caden, kun winye ki ikin lukerubi aryo, ma kun loko kwede.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Aron oketo lacib mac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Nia 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">37:17-24</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Wac bot Aron ni, ‘Ka icibo laput abironi iwi lacib mac, omyero iket ikabedo ma menyo nyim lacib mac.’” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Ci Aron otimo kitmeno; ocibo mac lapute malo wek gumeny kabedo ma inyim lacib mac, macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Man aye kit tic ma kiyubu kwede lacib mac, kiyubu ki jabu ma kiteto ki nyol. Nia ki itedi tere nio kwede wa cal aturene, kiyubu kun kiteto ki nyol. Moses oyubu lacib mac kun lubu kit cal ma Rwot onongo onyutu bote.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero Lulevi pi tic maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Kwany Lulevi woko ki ikin jo Icrael, ci ilonygi. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Ibitimogi kit man pi lonyogi: kir pii me lwoko balgi, ci wek gin gulyel komgi woko ducu ki lyedi, gulwok bongigi, gulonye keken gi. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Lacen wek gin gukwany wod twon kacel ki gityer me moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo, ka dok in ibikwanyo wod twon mukene pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Ka dong ibitero Lulevi inyim Kema me Rwate, kun nongo icoko lwak jo Icrael ducu kacel. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Ka itero Lulevi inyim Rwot, jo Icrael gibiketo cinggi iwigi. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Ka Aron bityero Lulevi inyim Rwot gubed gityer akwata ma oa ki bot jo Icrael, wek gubed katiyo tic pa Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Ka dok Lulevi gibiketo cinggi iwi twoni, ci ibityero acel pi gitum me bal, ki acel pi gitum awanga bot Rwot, pi kwanyo bal ki ikom Lulevi. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Ibitero Lulevi inyim Aron ki awobene, ci ibityerogi gubed gityer akwata bot Rwot.<verse eid="NUM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Ibipoko Lulevi woko ki ikin jo Icrael kitmeno, ci Lulevi dong bibedo jona. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Ka dong lacen Lulevi gibidonyo katiyo tic ma i Kema me Rwate, ka dong ityeko lonyogi kun ityerogi macalo gityer akwata. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Pien kityeko miyogi bota matwal ki ikin jo Icrael; atyeko kwanyogi pira kena ma ka lutino, kayo ma co pa jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Nia 13:2</ref></char></note>Pien lutino kayo ma co ducu ma ikin jo Icrael gin mera, pa dano ki pa lee bene; yam akwerogi gubed mera inino ma aneko iye lutino kayo ma co ducu ma i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Ci dong atyeko kwanyo jo pa Levi me leyo katyen gi, gin lutino kayo ma co ducu ma ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Dok atyeko miyo Lulevi bot Aron ki awobene me mot, kun gia woko ki ikin jo Icrael pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate pi jo Icrael, dok pi kwanyo bal ki ikom jo Icrael, wek gemo mo pe opot ikom jo Icrael pi nyiko cok ki Kabedo Maleng.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Moses, Aron ki lwak jo Icrael ducu gudyero Lulevi kit mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Lulevi gulonye keken gi ikom balgi; gulwoko bongigi; ka Aron otyerogi macalo gityer akwata inyim Rwot, ci Aron otimo gin lakwany bal ki ikomgi wek gubed ma gulony.<verse eid="NUM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Lacen Lulevi gudonyo katiyo ticgi i Kema me Rwate me konyo Aron ki awobene; kit ma onongo Rwot ociko ki Moses lok ma dok ikom Lulevi, ci kitimogi kitmeno.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kare me tic pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Man aye lok ma mako Lulevi: jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo wiye abic dok kwede malo gibidonyo ka cobo dog ticgi ma gitiyo pi Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />Ka mwaka me ditogi oromo pyere abic, ci dong gibiweko ticgi ma gitiyo, pe dong gibitic matwal. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Ento gibikonyo omegigi ma i Kema me Rwate wek gugwok cik ma mako ticgi, ento pe gibitiyo tic kikome. Ibitimo bot Lulevi kitmeno pi lok ma dok ikom ticgi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kwero Karama me Kato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Nia 12:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot oloko ki Moses i tim Cinai i dwe mukwongo me mwaka me aryone ma onongo dong gua woko ki i lobo Ejipt kun waco bote ni, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Jo Icrael myero gukwer nino madit me Kato ikare ma kiciko. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo i otyeno, ikare ma kiciko, en aye wubikwero iye Karama me Kato; wubikwero kun wulubu cike ducu ki lok ducu ma kiciko ikome.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Kitmeno Moses ociko jo Icrael ni gukwer Karama me Kato. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Ci gukwero Karama me Kato i dwe mukwongo, inino dwe apar wiye angwen, i otyeno i tim Cinai. Kit mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses, jo Icrael bene gutimo kitmeno. <verse eid="NUM 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Onongo tye jo mogo ma gudoko keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto, ma omiyo pe gutwero kwero Karama me Kato inino meno. Ci gucito bot Moses ki Aron inino meno, <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />kun giwaco ni, “Wan dong wadoko keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto; pingo kigengowa ni pe watyer gityer pa Rwot ikin jo Icrael ikare ma kiciko?” <verse eid="NUM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Ci Moses owaco botgi ni, “Kong wukur wek kong awiny gin ma Rwot biciko ma makowu.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ‘Kadi bed ngati mo ikinwu, nyo ikin likwayowu, odoko keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto, onyo otingo wot mabor, en pud twero kwero Karama me Kato pa Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Gin bikwerone i dwe malubu, inino dwe apar wiye angwen i otyeno. Gin bicamo iye mugati ma tobi pe iye ki dek mogo makec. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Nia 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:36">Jon 19:36</ref></char></note>Pe gibiweko gin mo dong nio odiko, cogone mo pe gibituru; gibikwero kun gilubu cik ducu ma mako Karama me Kato. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Ento dano ducu matye ma olonye, ma pe ocito kawot mo, ento okwero kwero Karama me Kato, dano meno pe kibikwano ikin jo Icrael, pien onongo pe otyero gityer pa Rwot ikare ma kiciko; dano meno bale bidok iwiye. <verse eid="NUM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />Ka larok mo obedo ikinwu, ka en kwero Karama me Kato pa Rwot, en bikwero kun lubu cik me Karama me Kato ki gin ma kiciko iye. Wubibedo ki cik acel pi labedo ki pi anywali me lobo.’”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pol iwi Kema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Nia 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Ikom nino ma kiguro iye kema pa Lubanga, en aye pol obino, oboyo kom kema woko, en kema lok me caden; ki i otyeno oumu wi kema manen macalo mac nio wa odiko. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Ci obedo kwede kitmeno jwijwi; pol umu wiye dyeceng, ki gin macalo mac umu dyewor. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Kace pol oware woko ki iwi kema, ci jo Icrael gicako wot anyim; i kabedo ka mapol ocung iye, jo Icrael giguru iye kemagi. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Jo Icrael gicako wot pi cik pa Rwot, dok pi cik pa Rwot giguru kemagi; kace pol pud oumu wi Kema pa Rwot, ci gin bene pud mede kibedo i gonygi. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Ka pol omede ki umu wi Kema pi nino mapol, jo Icrael bene gin mede ki gwoko cik ma mako tic pa Rwot kun pe gidak. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Ikare mukene pol umu wi kema pi nino mo manok, ci pi lubu cik pa Rwot gin bene mede ki bedo i gony megi kitmeno; dok pi lubu cik pa Rwot miyo gidak. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />I kine mukene pol bedo cake otyeno nio wa odiko; ka odiko pol oware woko ki iwiye, ci gicako wot; nyo ka omede orii pi nino acel ki dyewor acel, ci tek pol oware ki iwiye, ci gin bene cako wotgi. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Kadi bed pol orii iwiye pi nino aryo, nyo dwe acel, nyo pi kare mo malac, kace pol pud omede ki umu wi kema, kun bedo kenyo, ci jo Icrael bene kong gibedo i gonygi kun pe gidak; ento ka oware woko, ci gin bene gicako wot. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Pi lubu cik pa Rwot miyo giguru kemagi, dok pi lubu cik pa Rwot miyo gidak, kun gigwoko cik ma mako tic pa Rwot kit mayam Rwot ociko ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tum me ryal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Yub tum aryo me ryal ma ibitetogi ki nyol, ci ibitic kwedgi me lwongo lwaki ki pi turu kemagi ki cako wot. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Ka kikutu tum aryo ducu, ci lwak ducu bicoke kacel boti i dogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Ento ka kikutu tum acel keken, ci lutel wic, ma gin ludito ma i kaka ducu pa jo Icrael, gibicoke kacel boti. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Ka wukutugi okok malongo kicel, ci gony ma tung kunyango gibicako wot. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Ka wukutugi okok malongo tyen me aryone, ci gony ducu ma tung kupiny gibicako wot. Kibikutu tum kok malongo me cako wot anyim. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Ento ka wumito coko lwak kacel wubikutu, ento pe wukut okok malongo. <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Awobe pa Aron, ma gin aye ajwaki, gibikutu tum. Cik me kutu tum bibedo cik matwal botwu nio wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Ka wucito i mony kalweny ki lukworwu ma gidiyowu i lobowu, ci wubikuku oduru mony kun wukutu tum, wek Rwot Lubangawu opo pirwu ci olarwu ki bot lukworwu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Inino ma cwinywu yom iye bene, ki inino madito ma kicikowu pirgi, ki ikare me poo dwe ducu, wubikutu iye tum iwi gitum awanga mewu, ki iwi gitum mewu me gityer me berbedo; kibikutugi wek Lubanga opo pirwu; An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gua woko ki i Cinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />I mwaka me aryone, i dwe me aryone, ikom nino dwe pyere aryo, pol ocako ware woko ki iwi kema lok me caden. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Jo Icrael gucako wot, gua woko ki i tim Cinai kun giwoto, gikobo; ci pol ocito ocung wa i tim Paran. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Jo Icrael gudak tyen mukwongo malube ki kit ma Rwot yam ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Bendera me gony pa jo pa Juda aye gutelo yoo ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi aye Nakucon wod pa Aminadab. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Lawimony me kaka pa Icakar obedo Netanel wod pa Juar, <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />ki lawimony me kaka pa Jabulon obedo Eliab wod pa Kelon.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Ka kema pa Rwot dong kiputu, ci likwayo pa Gercon ki likwayo pa Merari ma gin tingo kema, gucako wotgi. <verse eid="NUM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Ci bendera me gony pa jo pa Reuben ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi obedo Elijur wod pa Cedeur. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Lawimony me kaka pa Cimeon obedo Celumiel wod pa Juricadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Lawimony me kaka pa Gad obedo Eliacap wod pa Deuel.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Ka dong jo pa Kokat gucako wot, kun gitingo jami maleng ducu. Kema onongo dong kiguro ocung ma gin peya guo. <verse eid="NUM 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Ka dok bendera me gony pa jo pa Epraim ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi obedo Elicama wod pa Amikud. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Lawimony me kaka pa Manace obedo Gamaliel wod pa Pedajur. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Lawimony me kaka pa Benjamin obedo Abidan wod pa Gideoni.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Lacen bendera me gony pa jo pa Dan ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu, kun gin aye gugiko ki inge gony ducu; lawimony meggi obedo Akiejer wod pa Amicadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Lawimony me kaka pa Acer obedo Pagiel wod pa Okran. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Lawimony me kaka pa Naputali obedo Akira wod pa Enan. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Man aye onongo kit wot pa jo Icrael, ma lubu buca monygi, ikare ma gin mol me cako wot.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Moses owaco bot Kobab wod pa Reuel ma Lamidian, won dakone ni, “Wan wacako wot me dak i kabedo ma Rwot ceng owaco pire ni ebimiyo botwa ni. Ber iwot kwedwa, ci wabitimi maber.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Ento Kobab owace ni, “An pe abicito; abidok i lobo tuwa ki bot lutuwa.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Moses ogamo ni, “Alegi, pe iwekwa, pien in ingeyo ni wabigony i tim, ci i bibedo botwa macalo wangwa. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Dok ka ibiwoto kwedwa, gin maber ducu ma Rwot bitimo wa, wan bene wabitimi kitmeno.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Ci gucako a woko ki inyim got pa Rwot, ci guwoto wot me nino adek; ci Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot owoto otelo nyimgi i wot me nino adek pi yenyo kabedo me yweyogi, <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />kun pol pa Rwot woto lamal kawigi ki i dyeceng, ikare ducu ma gitye kawot nia ki igonygi.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:1">Jab 68:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kare ducu ka Canduk cako wot, ci Moses waco ni, “Dong ia malo, ai Rwot imii lumerok meri guket woko ata; wek jo ma dagi guring woko ki inyimi.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Ka dong ocung kayweyo, ci en dok waco ni, “Dong idwog cen, ai Rwot, bot lwak alip ki alip me Icrael.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukok pi ringo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Dano gubedo kalok ki akeca pi can ducu ma gitye iye, ci Rwot owinyo; ka Rwot otyeko winyone, kiniga omake, ci mac pa Rwot opoto, olyel ikin gi, owango kabedo mogo ma inget gony. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Ka lwak gukok bot Moses, ci Moses olego Rwot, ka mac ocako pye. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni, Tabera,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="fk">Tabera </char> teloke ni wango.</note> pien mac pa Rwot owang ikin gi.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Ikare meno lwak lurok mogo ma onongo gitye ikin jo Icrael cwinygi opuke matek pi ringo, ma omiyo jo Icrael bene gucako koko, kun giwaco ni, “Lutuwa, anga ma bimiyowa ringo me acamawa? <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Pud wapoo pi rec mayam wacamo nono i Ejipt, ki pi okwer ki okono ki kitunggulu maboco ki kitunggulu matino ki kitunggulu matik; <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />ento ikare man kero komwa dong peke, dok gin mo bene dong peke, kono nyo manna man ma waneno ni keken.”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:31">Nia 16:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Onongo manna nen macalo nyig koo, dok bene nen macalo odok yat ma kilwongo bedola. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:13-15">Nia 16:13-15</ref></char></note>Dano gubedo kacito ka jobone, ka girego ki kidi nyo odo ki pany, ka gitedo ki agulu, nyo giyubu ki capat; ka gicamo. Mite rom ki mit pa capat ma kitedo ki moo. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Ka toyo oluk i dye gony ki i dyewor, ci manna bene poto piny.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses oyero ludongo pyere abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Moses owinyo ka dano gikok i dogolagi ducu, kun ngat acel acel tye i dog kemane; ci kiniga omako Rwot matek, Moses bene cwinye pe obedo yom. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Moses owaco bot Rwot ni, “Pingo i tima marac kuman? Pingo an pe anongo gum mo inyimi, ma omiyo in dong iketo peko pa lwak man ducu ikoma? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Onongo an aye abedo min lwak man ducu bo? An aye yam anywalogi bo, ma omiyo iwaco bota ni atinggi i kora, macalo lapidi tingo latin ma pud dot, atergi i lobo mayam ikwongo pire ni ibimiyo bot kwarigi? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />An kono abinongo ringo ki kwene me amiya ki lwak dano man ducu? Pien gitye ka kok inyima kun gin waco ni, ‘Mii ki wan ringo wek wacam.’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />An pe atwero tingo lwak dano man pira kena; yece pek mukato kare. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Ka man aye kit ma ibitiyo ki an, ci ber ineka woko ma kicel, kace anongo gum mo inyimi, wek pe abed kaneno can kuman.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Cokka jo pyere abiro ki ikin ludongo pa jo Icrael, ma ingeyo ni gin ludongo ki ikin lwak ki ludito maloyogi; ci ikelgi i Kema me Rwate, wek gucung kunu kacel kwedi. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />An abilor piny abino kalok kwedi kunu; ci abikwanyo twero ma mera mukene matye i komini, ci abiketo ikomgi; miyo gibinywako tingo peko pa lwak kacel kwedi, wek in pe dong ibed katingone piri keni. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Dok iwac bot lwak ni, ‘Wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng pi nino ma diki, ci wubicamo ringo; pien wubedo kakoko i it Rwot kun wuwaco ni, anga ma bimiyowa ringo me acamawa? Pien yam onongo watye maber giwa i Ejipt. Pimeno Rwot bimiyowu ringo ci wubicamo. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Pe wubicamo pi nino acel keken, nyo nino aryo, nyo abic, nyo apar, nyo pyere aryo, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />ento wubicamo pi dwe acel kulu, nio ka bikati woko ki i umwu, nio ka bicido cwinywu woko, pien wutyeko kwero Rwot ma bedo i kinwuni kun wukok inyime ki pig wangwu, wuwaco ni, pingo yam waa woko ki i Ejipt?’” <verse eid="NUM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Ento Moses ogamo ni, “Jo ma abedo ikin gi welgi romo alip miya abicel, co ma gin woto ki tyen gi, ci in iwaco ni, ‘Abimiyogi ringo wek gucam pi dwe kulu!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Kadi bed kinek lwak lee makwo, romi ki dyangigu, ci biromogi? Nyo kadi kicoko lwak rec ducu matye i nam kacel pirgi, ci biromogi?” <verse eid="NUM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Ci Rwot ogamo dog Moses ni, “Cing Rwot aye dong odoko cek bo? Ibineno tin kace loka bicobe boti kakare onyo pe.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludongo guloko macalo lunebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Moses okato woko katito ki dano lok ma Rwot owaco; ci ocoko jo pyere abiro ki ikin ludongo pa jo Icrael, oketogi gurumu Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Ka Rwot olor piny ki i pol, ci oloko kwedgi, ci Lubanga okwanyo twerone mukene matye ikom Moses ci, oketo ikom ludongo pyere abironi. Ka cwiny pa Lubanga opoto ikomgi, ci gucako lok macalo lunebi. Ento pe dok gumede ki timo kitmeno.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Onongo jo aryo gudong cen igony, acel nyinge Eldad ki mukene nyinge Medad, ci cwiny pa Lubanga opoto ikomgi bene. Gin onongo gitye ikin jo mayam kicoyo nyinggini, ento pe gukato woko gucito i Kema me Rwate, ma omiyo gubedo kalok macalo lunebi i dye gony. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Ci latin awobi mo oringo otito bot Moses ni, “Eldad ki Medad gitye kalok macalo lunebi i dye gony.” <verse eid="NUM 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Ci Yocwa wod pa Nun, ma onongo obedo lakony pa Moses nicake wa itinone, owaco ni, “Moses, ladita, jukgi woko.” <verse eid="NUM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Ento Moses owaco bote ni, “In mono itye ka paro pira ce? Kono onongo jo pa Rwot ducu gubedo lunebi, kono onongo bera mada, wek Rwot oony cwiny mere ikomgi bene!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Ci Moses ki ludongo pa jo Icrael gudok cen igony.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocwalo aluru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Ka Rwot omiyo yamo okodo, ci okelo lwak aluru nia ki i nam, ci gupoto piny inget gony. Lace romo kilomita acel, ma orumu gony woko ducu, dok gudure piny maromo mita acel kulu me a ki i ngom. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Dano gutware ka cokogi inino meno dyeceng ki dyewor benebene, ki orwone bene. Jo ma gucoko manok keken gucoko maromo guniya pyere adek; ci gucako moyone orumu gony weng. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Ikare ma pud gitye ka mwodo ringo, ma peya gucamo otum, kiniga omako Rwot ikom dano, ci opwodo lwak ki two gemo mapek. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Ma omiyo gulwongo nying kabedo meno ni, Kibrot-atava,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="fk">Kibrot-atava </char>teloke ni <char style="ft" closed="false">Lyel pa lukee.</char></note> pien jo ma gin lukee tutwal kiyikogi kunu. <verse eid="NUM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Nia ki i Kibrot-atava lwak gucako wot me cito Kajerot, ci gutiro gubedo kunu.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga opwodo Miriam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Onongo Moses onyomo dako mo ma nya jo Kuc, ci Miriam ki Aron gucako loko lok marac ikom Moses pi dako meno. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Gubedo kawaco ni, “Rwot obedo kalok ki dog Moses kene bo? Pe obedo kalok ki dogwa bene?” Ci Rwot owinyo. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Moses onongo yam mwol adada, mwol makato dano ducu ma onongo yam gitye iwi loboni. <verse eid="NUM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Cutcut Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ki Miriam ni, “Wukat woko, wun adek ducu, wubin i Kema me Rwate.” Ci gin adek ducu gukato woko. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Ci Rwot olor piny ki i wir me pol, ocung i dog Kema me Rwate, ka olwongo Aron ki Miriam. Gin aryo ducu gukato anyim. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Ci owaco botgi ni, “Wuwiny loka. Kace tye lanebi mo ikinwu, ci An a Rwot aweko en ngeya ki iginanyuta, aloko kwede ki iwang lek. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:2">Ibru 3:2</ref></char></note>Ento bot latica Moses pe bedo kitmeno; pien atyeko keto lwaka ducu i cinge. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Abedo kalok kwede wang ki wang, kamaleng atyer, pe agongo lok mo; en neno kit ma Rwot cal kwede. Pingo pe wulworo loko lok marac ikom latica Moses?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Kiniga omako Rwot ikomgi, ci ocito woko. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Ka pol oware woko ki iwi Kema me Rwate, ci nen, kom Miriam orugu woko cut, okwor matar macalo pee. Ka Aron oloke tung bot Miriam, oneno kome orugu woko matar <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />ci owaco bot Moses ni, “Ai, ladita, pe iket can ikomwa pien watimo lok me mingo, dong wabalo. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Pe iwek en obed macalo latin ma kinywalo ma dong oto, ma ringo kome nucune dong obale woko ma pud oa aaya ki ii mine.” <verse eid="NUM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Ci Moses okok bot Rwot kun waco ni, “Cange ba, ai Lubanga, abako doga boti do.” <verse eid="NUM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:2-3">Wel 5:2-3</ref></char></note>Ento Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Ka nene wone ongulu laa i wange keken, kono onongo pe en obedo ki lewic pi nino abiro? Wek kong kitweye woko inge gony pi nino abiro, ka lacen kibikele dong igony.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Kitmeno kitweyo Miriam woko inge gony pi nino abiro; ci lwak pe gumedo ki dak kamukene nio ka Miriam odwogo igony. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Ka dong lacen dano gucako wot nia ki i Kajerot, ci gugony i tim me Paran.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo lurotpiny apar wiye aryo i lobo Kanaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Nwo 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Cwal dano acel ki i kaka acel acel kun dano meno nongo latela ki i kakane wek gucit gurot lobo Kanaan ma abimiyo bot jo Icrael.” <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Ci Moses ocwalogi ki i tim me Paran, kit macalo Rwot ociko. Gin ducu onongo gin ludito ikin jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Nyinggi ene: i kaka pa Reuben, Camua wod pa Jakur; <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />i kaka pa Cimeon, Capat wod pa Kori; <verse eid="NUM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />i kaka pa Juda, Kaleb wod pa Jepune; <verse eid="NUM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />i kaka pa Icakar, Igal wod pa Yucepu; <verse eid="NUM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />i kaka pa Epraim, Kocea wod pa Nun; <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />i kaka pa Benjamin, Palti wod pa Rapu; <verse eid="NUM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />i kaka pa Jabulon, Gadiel wod pa Codi; <verse eid="NUM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />i kaka pa Yucepu, en aye kaka pa Manace, Gadi wod pa Cuci; <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />i kaka pa Dan, Amiel wod pa Gemali; <verse eid="NUM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />i kaka pa Acer Cetur wod pa Mikael; <verse eid="NUM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />i kaka pa Naputali, Nabi wod pa Vopci; <verse eid="NUM 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />i kaka pa Gad, Geuel wod pa Maki. <verse eid="NUM 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Meno aye nying jo ma Moses ocwalogi ka roto lobo Kanaan. Moses ocako nying Kocea wod pa Nun ni Yocwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Moses ocwalogi ka roto lobo Kanaan kun waco botgi ni, “Wucit i Negeb kuca, wuit malo wa i lobo godi, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />wek wunen kit ma lobo meno tye kwede, kace jo ma bedo iye jo matego nyo jo magoro, kace ginok nyo gipol, <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />kace lobo ma gibedo iyeni ber nyo rac, kace taun ma gibedo iye tye apero nyo kirumu ki cel matego, <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />kace lobone ceko cam nyo pe ceko, kace yadi tye i lobone nyo peke. Wucam co ki i cwinywu, ci wudwog ki nyig yadi mogo ma ocek i lobo kunu.” Kare ma gicito onongo obedo kare ma nyig olok cako cek iye.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Kitmeno gucito ka roto piny nia ki i tim Jin nio kwede wa i Rekob, macok ki yoo madonyo i Kamat. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Gucito nio wa i Negeb ka guo kwede i Kebron; kama Akiman, Cecai ki Talmai likwayo pa Anak onongo gitye kunu. (Kebron onongo dong kigero orii mwaka abiro ma peya kigero Joan ma i Ejipt.) <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Lurot piny guo wa i nota me Ecikol, ci gungolo jang tug olok acel ma olugu, gutingo ki tal mabor kun jo aryo aye lebo, <figure style="fig" alt="A Cluster of grapes" file="CO00856B.TIF" size="col" loc="Num. 13:23" copy="David Cook" ref="13:23">Jang tug olok acel</figure> ki bene gukelo nyig pomegranat ki nyig oduru. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Kabedo meno yam kilwongo ni nota me Ecikol,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="fk">Ecikol </char> te loke ni tuga nyig yat ma olugu.</note> pien jo Icrael gungolo iye jang tuga olok.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />I nge nino pyere angwen lurot piny gudwogo ki ka roto piny ma i lobo meno. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Gudwogo bot Moses ki Aron ki lwak jo Icrael ducu ma i tim Paran, i Kadec. Gin gukelo lok bot lwak ducu, dok bene gunyutu botgi gin ma ocek ki i lobo meno. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Ci gutito ki Moses ni, “Wacito i lobo ma icwalowa iye; lobone miu dok ceko cam mabup, man aye nyig yadine ma wakelo ki kunu. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Ento jo ma bedo i lobone jo matego, taun gi madito bene kicelo ki cel ma tego, dok gidito tutwal; medo ki meno, waneno iye likwayo pa Anak. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Jo Amalek gibedo meggi i lobo ma i Negeb; jo Kit, jo Jebuc ki jo Amor gibedo i lobo godi; jo Kanaan gibedo i lobo murabo dog Nam Mediterranean, ki murabo dog Jordan.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Kaleb ojuku dano guling woko inyim Moses ci owaco ni, “Wan watugi cito kunu makicel, wek wacamu woko; pien wan waromo loyogi.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Ento dano mayam gunywako kwede wot kunu guwaco ni, “Wan pe waromo ette me cito ikom jo meno, pien gitego, makatowa woko.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Ci gukelo lok marac ma obalo cwiny jo Icrael woko ikom lobo ma gurotoni, kun giwaco ni, “Lobo ma wawoto wabaro iyeni, waroto ducu, lobone konye peke, ma pe ceko cam. Dok jo ducu ma wanenogi iye kunu jo ma komgi pek madito. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:4">Aca 6:4</ref></char></note>Dok waneno twoni oluma kunu, likwayo pa Anak ma kwarigi ducu twoni oluma. Wan giwa watino warom ki otwongo mamwa, dok wanen kitmeno ki tung botgi.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gujemo ikom Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Lwak ducu gucako dange matek, ci dano gukok ki pig wanggi dyewor benebene. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Jo Icrael ducu gubedo ka ngur ikom Moses ki Aron, ci lwakgi ducu guwaco botgi ni, “Kono nene wato giwa ki i Ejipt, kono ber! Nyo kono nene wato ki i tim kany! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Pingo Rwot okelowa i lobo man wek kinekwa woko ki pala lucwan? Monwa ki lutinowa kibiyakogi woko bene; onongo bedo ber ka wadok giwa cen i Ejipt?”<verse eid="NUM 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Ci gucako lok keken gi kun giwaco ni, “Wek wayeru laditwa mo, wek wadoku cen i Ejipt.” <verse eid="NUM 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Ci Moses ki Aron gupoto piny inyim lwak jo Icrael aryeba ic pi cwercwiny. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Ci Yocwa wod pa Nun ki Kaleb wod pa Jepune mayam gitye ikin jo ma guroto lobo meno guyeco bongigi keken gi pien cwinygi ocwer. <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />Gin guwaco, bot lwak jo Icrael ducu ni, “Lobo mayam wawoto wabaro iye, waroto, wanongo ni lobone ber makato ducu. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Ka Rwot iye yom ikomwa, ci en biterowa i lobo meno, ci miyo i cingwa, lobo ma miu maceko cam madwong. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ibru 3:16</ref></char></note>Ento pe wujem ikom Rwot; dok pe wulwor wegi lobo meno, pien gin mere kwon me acamawa. Gin mo magengo ngegi dong peke, dok Rwot tye tung botwa; pe wulworgi.” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Ento lwak ducu guwaci kicel Yocwa ki Keleb acela ki got.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 14:10">Ka dok deyo pa Rwot onen i Kema me Rwate inyim jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Jo man gin bicaya pi kare marom mene? Gibikwero ye an pi kare marom mene, kadi bed atiyo lwak lanyut ducu marom man ikin gi? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Abipwodogi ki two gemo, abitwonogi lobo ma nene myero obed me aleyagi, dok abimiyo in idoko rok madit mada ki matek makatogi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Nia 32:11-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento Moses owaco bot Rwot ni, “Jo Ejipt dok gibiwinyo pire bene, pien in aye yam itingo jo man ki teki ci ikwanyogi woko ki ikin gi, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />dok gibitito bot jo ma gibedo i lobo man. Gin dong gutyeko winyo ni in Rwot itye idyewa, dok ni in Rwot aye bene inen wang ki wang botwa, ki pol meri obedo ka cung ka wiwa, dok ibedo kawot inyimwa iwir pol dyeceng ki i wir mac dyewor. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Ka ineko jo man woko lawange acel, ci lurok ma gin winyo ywekani gibiwaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Lubanga onongo ni tero jo man i lobo mayam en okwongo pire ni ebimiyo botgini dong oloye woko, en aye ma omiyo en onekogi woko i dye tim.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Kombedi alegi ni, wek tek pa Rwot obed madit kit macalo yam iciko kun iwaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Nia 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Nwo 5:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9-10">7:9-10</ref></char></note>‘Rwot kiniga pe mako oyot, mar mere ma pe loke dwong; en weko bal ki tim aranyi pa dano, ento pe kwanyo kop ki ikom lubalo. En keto can ikom likwayo ki ikom likwayo pa likwayogi pi bal pa kwarogi nio i yalwak me adek ki me angwen.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Alegi ni i tim kica ki joni man pi rocgi, macalo in mari ma pe loke dwong tutwali, kit ma ibedo ka weko balgi cake wa ikare ma gua ki i Ejipt nio wa onyo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma Lubanga oketo ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:34-40">Nwo 1:34-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Dong atimo kica botgi kit macalo iwaconi. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:18">Ibru 3:18</ref></char></note>Ento i ada, macalo atye kwo ni, dok macalo deyo pa Rwot bipongo lobo ducuni, akwongo ni: <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />ikom jo ma guneno deyona ki lwak lanyut mayam atiyo i Ejipt ki i tim, ento ma gubedo kaomo iya madong odoko tyen apar kuluni, ma pe guwinyo doga bene, pe tye ngat mo ikin gi <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />ma bineno lobo mayam akwongo pire bot kwarogi ni abimiyogi ni. Pe tye ngat mo ikin jo ma gicaya ma binenone. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:9-12">Yoc 14:9-12</ref></char></note>Ento latica Kaleb abitero i lobo mayam ocito iyeni, ci likwaye bicamo, pien en tye ki cwiny mapat, dok en tye kalubu gin ma amito ducu kakare atir. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan gin bedo i nota ducu; pimeno wun diki wuloke wucak wot wudok tung tim i yoo ma kemo Nam Makwar.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ki bot Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Lwak man maraci biweko nguru ikoma wa awene? Dong atyeko winyo lwak nguru ma jo Icrael gitye kanguru kwede ikoma. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Wac botgi ni an a Rwot awaco ni, ‘Macalo atye makwo ni, lok ducu ma wuloko ma awinyo ki ita abitiyo botwu. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:17">Ibru 3:17</ref></char></note>Komwu ma oto birade piny i dye tim man. Ikin jo ma kikwanogi ni, mayam kikwano welgi cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo, ma gubedo ka ngur ikomani, <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />pe tye ngat acel mo ma bio i lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyogi bedo iye; kono Kaleb wod pa Jepune ki Yocwa wod pa Nun keken. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Ento lutinowu ma wuwaco ni kibiyakogi wokoni, gin aye abiterogi kunu, gin aye gibingeyo lobo ma wun wucayoni. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Wun aye komwu ma oto birade piny i dye tim man. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Tic 7:36</ref></char></note>Lutinowu gibibedo ka lak i tim macalo lukwat pi mwaka pyere angwen kun gineno can pi balwu, nio ka kom danowu ma oto me agikine obutu i dye tim. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Wubineno can pi balwu pi mwaka pyere angwen, muporo wel nino mayam wuroto ki loboni, nino pyere angwen, mwaka acel pi nino acel acel, ci wubingeyo ni iya oari woko ki ikomwu.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />An a Rwot madong aloko; ada abitiyo man ikom lwak man maraci ducu ma guribe me pyem kweda; gibitum woko i dye tim kany, gin bito megi kunu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Jo mayam Moses ocwalogi ka roto loboni, mayam gudwogo ci gumiyo lwak ducu gungur ikom Rwot pi lok marac ma gutito ikom lobo meno, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />jo meno ducu guto woko ki two gemo inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Ento Yocwa wod pa Nun ki Kaleb wod pa Jepune aye gudong makwo ki ikin lwak dano ma gucito ka roto loboni.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiloyo jo Icrael ki i Korma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Nwo 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Moses otito lok meno ducu bot jo Icrael, ci dano gukok matek. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Ci gua malo odiko con, gucito guito malo wa i lacol me godi, kun giwaco ni, “Nen, wan dong watye kany, wabicito wa i kabedo ma Rwot ociko pire; pien dong wabalo.” <verse eid="NUM 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Ento Moses owaco botgi ni, “Pingo wun dok wumede ki turu cik ma Rwot oketo? Pien meno pe bitwere wa ki acel. <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Pe wucit kunu, wek pe lumerokwu guradwu woko piny, pien Rwot pe tye ikinwu. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan gitye inyimwu kunu, pala lucwangi bityekowu woko; pien wun wukwero lubu kor Rwot, omiyo Rwot pe bibedo kwedwu.” <verse eid="NUM 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Ento gin guete ni gimito ito malo wa i lacol lobo godi ca, kadi bed Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot, ki Moses bene pe gua woko ki i gony. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Ci jo Amalek ki jo Kanaan ma gibedo i lobo godi kunu gulor piny, guloyogi, ci guryemogi nio wa i Korma.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Cik mapatpat ma mako gityer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Wac ki jo Icrael ni, ka dong wuo i lobo ma wubibedo iye, ma abimiyowuni, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />ce wutyero dyang nyo romo bot Rwot me gityer ma kiwango ki mac, nyo gitum awanga, nyo kit gitum mukene, nyo gityer me cobo kwong, nyo gityer ma ic opwoyo, nyo ka wutyero gityer i ninowu madito ma kiciko, gityer magi gibibedo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />Ngat ma okelo gityere bot Rwot omyero otyere bene moko kwon mapwot maromo agwata acel ma kirubu ki moo maromo lita acel, obed gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Dok wubikelo lita acel ki nucu me kongo bwino me gityer amata pi gitum awanga nyo gitum mukene ducu pi romo acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Pi nyok romo wubikelo moko kwon mapwot maromo agwata aryo ma kirubu ki moo maromo cupa adek pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Pi gityer amata wubikelo lita acel ki nucu me kongo bwino makur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Ka wuyubu twon pi gitum awanga, nyo pi gitum mukene, nyo pi cobo kwong, nyo pi gityer me berbedo ma wutyero bot Rwot, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />ci myero wutyer kacel ki moko kwon mapwot maromo agwata adek ma kirubu ki moo maromo lita aryo wek obed gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Pi gityer amata wubityero kongo bwino maromo lita aryo obed gityer ma kiwango ki mac. Gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Kibitiyo kitmeno pi twon acel acel, nyo pi nyok romo acel acel, nyo pi wod romo nyo latin nyok dyel acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Magi ducu bilubu wel lim ma wukelo me atyera; wubitiyo kitmeno ikomgi ki acel acel macalo welgi tye. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Anywali ducu me lobowu gibitiyo kitmeno ka gityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac wek obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Ka larok mo odoko labedo ikinwu, nyo ngat mo ma bibedo ikinwu wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ka en mito tyero gityer ma kiwango ki mac obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot, ci en bene bitimone kit ma wun wutimoni. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Pi lwak mucoke cik bibedo acel pirwu ki pi larok ma odoko labedo ikinwu; meno bibedo cik matwal nio wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu; labedo bibedo marom ki wun inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:22">Lev 24:22</ref></char></note>Cik bibedo acel ki ngolo kop bene bibedo acel pi wun ki pi lurok ma gibedo ikinwu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dong wuo i lobo ma atye ka terowu iyeni, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />ka wucamo cam ma ocek i lobo meno, ci wubityero gityer bot Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Ikom moko kwon me ngano manyen mukwongo cek wubityero mugati acel obed gityer; wubityero macalo wutyero gityer ma wukwanyo ki ikom ngano ma wudino. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Wubimiyo gityer bot Rwot ki ikom moko kwon me ngano manyen mukwongo cek, wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />Ento kace wuroco, ma kun pe wumako cik magi ducu ma Rwot yam ociko ki Moses, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />ki gin ducu ma Rwot ocikowu kwede ki i dog Moses, nia wa inino mayam Rwot okwongo miyo iye cik, mede kwede wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu; <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />kace dano guroco ma pe gubalo akaka, kun lwak pe ngeyo gin mo iye, ci lwak ducu bityero wod twon acel me gitum awanga obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en macalo cik tye, kacel ki nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Ajwaka pa Lubanga bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom lwak jo Icrael ducu, ci Rwot biweko balgi; pien onongo pe gubalo akaka dok gukelo gityergi, gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, ki gitumgi me bal, inyim Rwot pi balgi ma pe gutimo akaka. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Ci kibiweko bal pa lwak jo Icrael ducu, kacel ki pa lurok ma gibedo ikin gi, pien onongo bal meno omako lwak ducu.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 4:27-31">Lev 4:27-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kace dano acel mo aye obalo ma pe otimo akaka, ci en bityero bwong dyel madite romo mwaka acel pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Ci ajwaka pa Lubanga bitimo gin lakwany bal inyim Rwot pi dano meno ma opoto i bal ma pe otimo akaka, pi kwanyo bal ki ikome, ci Rwot biweko bale. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Wubibedo ki cik acel pi dano ma obalo ma pe otimo akaka, kadi bed en anywali pa jo Icrael nyo labedo ma bedo ikinwu. <verse eid="NUM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />Ento ka dano mo otimo bal akaka, kadi bed anywali me lobo nyo labedo, nongo dong ocayo Rwot; dano meno kibiryemo woko ki ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Nongo en ocayo lok pa Rwot, oturu cike, pimeno dano meno kibiryemo woko pe dok bibedo ikin jo Icrael.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano ma pe ogwoko ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Ikare ma jo Icrael gitye i tim, ci gunongo dano mo ka coko yen rido i ceng Cabit. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Jo ma gunonge ka en coko yen ridoni gukele bot Moses ki Aron ki bot lwak ducu. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Ci gukete iot kol, pien peya kinyutu botgi gin ma myero gutim ikome. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Dano meno kibineke woko. Lwak ducu bicele ki got woko inge gony.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ci lwak ducu gukele woko inge gony, ci gucele ki got guneke woko, kit macalo Rwot onongo ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keto jira i dog bongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:12">Nwo 22:12</ref></char></note>“Lok ki jo Icrael ci icikgi ni gukwo jira i twok dog bongigi, wa ikare pa likwayogi ducu, dok jira ma i twok dog bongo acel acel guket iye tol ma bulu. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Man bibedo botwu jira dog bongo ma wuneno kome wek wupo ikom cik pa Rwot ducu, wulubgi, kun pe wulubu tamwu kenwu ki gin ma wuneno, ma wumaro lubu pi mitiwu kenwu. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Kitmeno miyo wubipo cika ducu, dok wubicobogi, miyo wubibedo jo maleng pi Lubangawu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />An a Rwot Lubangawu mayam akwanyowu ki i lobo Ejipt wek abed Lubangawu; An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Jemo pa Kora, Datan ki Abiram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JUD 1:11">Jud 11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kora wod pa Ijar, ma wod pa Kokat, wod pa Levi, kacel ki Datan ki Abiram awobe pa Eliab ki On wod pa Pelet, ma gin adek ducu gubedo likwayo pa Reuben, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />gupiyo dano ikom Moses. Gin guribe ki jo mukene ma ikin jo Icrael, lutel wi lwak miya aryo ki pyere abic ma guyero ki ikin lwak jo ma gin ngene mada. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Gucoke kacel ikom Moses ki Aron ci guwaco botgi ni, “Mewu dong okato kakare woko! Pien jo magi ducu gin lwak maleng, gin ducu ki acel acel Rwot bene tye ikin gi. Ci pingo wun wukete kenwu malo tutwal makato lwak pa Rwot ducu?” <verse eid="NUM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Ka Moses owinyo, ci opoto aryeba ic pi cwercwiny. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Ka dong owaco bot Kora ki lwake ducu ni, “Diki odiko Rwot aye binyutu danone ki ngat maleng ikinwa, ci bimiyo en nyiko cok bote; ngat ma en oyero aye en bimiyo nyiko cok. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Dong wutim kit man; wukwany weer me wango odok eceta, Kora ki lwake ducu. <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />Diki wuket mac iye, ci wuket iye odok eceta inyim Rwot, ci dano ma Rwot oyero aye bibedo maleng. Wun mewu dong okato kare woko, wun likwayo pa Levi!” <verse eid="NUM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Moses dok owaco bot Kora ni, “Kong dong wuwiny ya, wun likwayo pa Levi. <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Wun wubwono man ni gin matidi ce, ma Lubanga pa Icrael aye opokowu woko ki ikom lwak jo Icrael me kelowu cok bote pi tiyo tic i Kema pa Rwot, wek wucung inyim lwak katic pirgi? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />En dong okelowu kamacok kwede wun kacel ki utmegiwu ducu ma gin likwayo pa Levi, ci dok pud wuyenyo yo me doko ajwaki aye? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Wun wubedo ka jemo ikom Rwot, ma omiyo wun ki lwakwu ducu wucoke kaceli. Aron kono gin ango ma omiyo wungur ikomeni?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Ci Moses dok ocwalo dano pi lwongo Datan ki Abiram ma awobe pa Eliab; ento gin guwaco ni, “Pe wabicito kunu. <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Pud ibwono man ni gin matidi mo, ma ikwanyowa woko ki i lobo ma miu ma ceko cam mapol, ma itye ka nekowa kwede i timi? Myero in dok ikete keni me bedo laker maloyowa? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Dok bene peya ikelowa i lobo mo ma miu ma ceko cam mapol, peya imiyowa poti mogo ma waleyo, nyo poti olok, ci kombedi dong i mito umu wangwa woko. Wan pe wabicito kunu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Ci kiniga omako Moses matek ci owaco bot Rwot ni, “Pe iye gityergi. An peya akwanyo kadi kanagi acel mo ki botgi, pe atimo gin marac ikom ngat mo ikin gi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Lacen Moses owaco bot Kora ni, “In kacel ki lwaki wubed tye inyim Rwot diki. Aron bene bibedo tye. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Ngat acel acel ikinwu omako atabo weene me wango odok eceta. Wuket iye odok eceta, ci ngat acel acel okel atabo weene inyim Rwot, atabo wee miya aryo ki pyere abic; ki in bene Aron, ngat man ki atabo weene.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Orwone ngat acel acel okwanyo atabo weene, ci guketo mac i igi, ka guketo odok eceta iye, ci gucung i dog Kema me Rwate, kacel ki Moses ki Aron. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kora ocoko lwake jo ducu ci gucung ma gukeme ki Moses ki Aron idogola Kema me Rwate. Ci deyo pa Rwot onen bot lwak ducu.<verse eid="NUM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Wupoke woko kenwu ki ikin lwak man, wek anekgi atyekgi woko kombedi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Ento gin gupoto piny aryeba ic ci guwaco ni, “Ai Lubanga, in aye Lubanga ma won tipu kom jo ducu, pi bal pa dano acel keken miyo kiniga maki ikom lwak ducu?” <verse eid="NUM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Cik lwak ni gua woko ki kama jo pa Kora, Datan ki Abiram gibedo iye.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Ci Moses oa ocito bot Datan ki Abiram, ci ludongo pa jo Icrael gulubu kore. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Ci owaco bot lwak ni, “Alegowu ni, wua wupoke ki inget kema pa jo magi ma giraconi, pe wugud kom jamigi mo, wek pe kijwerwu woko kacel kwedgi pi bal meggi ducu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Omiyo dano gua woko ki inget kema pa Kora, Datan ki Abiram; ci Datan ki Abiram gukati woko gucung i dog kemagi kacel ki mon gi ki awobegi ki lutinogi matino. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Ci Moses owaconi, “Man aye gin ma bimiyo wungeyo ni Rwot onongo ocwala katiyo tic man ducu, pe abedo katiyone pira kena. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Kace jo man bito ikit ma dano gito kwede jwijwini, nyo kit keckom ma poto ikom dano ducu en aye bipoto ikomgi, ci pe nongo Rwot aye ma ocwala. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Ento ka Rwot oketo gin mo manyen, ce lobo ongamo doge omwonyogi woko ducu, lwakgi ki jamigi ducu, miyo gilor piny i bur lyel ma pud gikwo, ci wubingeyo ni, jo man gubedo kacayo Rwot.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Ka Moses otyeko waco lok meno ducu, ci ngom ma gucung iyeni obar oyabe woko, <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />lobo ongamo doge omwonyogi woko, kacel ki jo me odigi, ki lwak jo pa Kora ducu ki jamigi ducu liweng. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Kitmeno gin ki lwakgi ki jamigi ducu gulor piny i bur lyel ma gin kwo; ci lobo oumu wigi woko gurwenyo woko ki ikin lwak. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Jo Icrael ducu ma onongo gurumugi ni guringo woko ka guwinyo kokogi, kun giwaco ni, “Wek lobo pe dok omwonywa bene!” <verse eid="NUM 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Ka dok mac bene oa ki bot Rwot, owango jo meno miya aryo ki pyere abic ma gubedo ka tyero odok ecetani, otyekogi woko.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Ka Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Cik Eleajar wod pa ajwaka Aron ni okwany atabo wee me wango odok eceta woko ducu ki imac ma lyeli, ci oony mac ma i igi ni kamabor, pien gin jami maleng. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Atabo wee pa jo meno ma balgi okelo can me to ikomgini myero kipadgi woko malac ki nyol gudok laum wi keno tyer; pien onongo yam dong kityerogi woko inyim Rwot ma omiyo pud gin jami maleng. Ci bibedo lanyut bot jo Icrael.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Kitmeno Eleajar okwanyo atabo wee me mola mayam jo ma mac owangogi ni gutyero, ci kipadogi weng gudoko laum wi keno tyer. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Man obedo lanyut bot jo Icrael, ni ngat mo ma pe ajwaka pa Lubanga, ma pe lakwar Aron, pe onyik cok ka wango odok eceta inyim Rwot, wek pe odok macalo Kora ki lwake. Kit macalo Rwot owaco bot Eleajar ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aron olaro lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Ento orwone lwak jo Icrael ducu dok gucako ngur ikom Moses ki Aron kun giwaco ni, “Wun aye wuneko jo pa Rwot woko.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Ka lwak gutyeko coke ikom Moses ki Aron, ci Moses ki Aron oloke okemo Kema me Rwate; ci nen, pol oumu kome woko, deyo pa Rwot ocako nen. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Ci Moses ki Aron gucito inyim Kema me Rwate, <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Wua woko ki ikin lwak man wek atyekgi woko kombedi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Ento Moses ki Aron gupoto piny aryeba cwiny, <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />ci Moses owaco bot Aron ni, “Kwany atabo weeni me wango odok eceta, wek iket iye mac ma itoko ki ikeno tyer, ci iket iye odok eceta, iting iter kama lwak tye iye oyotoyot. Tim gin lakwany bal ki ikomgi, pien kiniga pa Rwot dong ocako bino woko, two gemo dong ocake woko.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Ci Aron okwanyo atabo wee kit ma Moses owaco, cut oringo kwede i dye lwak; ci nen, two gemo onongo dong ocake ikin dano. Ci oketo odok eceta i atabo wee, ocako timo gin lakwany bal ki ikom lwak. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Ci Aron ocung ikin jo ma oto ki jo makwo, ci two gemo ogik woko. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Jo ma two gemo onekogi giromo dano alip apar wiye angwen ki miya abiro, kun pe kiribo iye jo ma guto i alii pa Kora. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Ka two gemo dong ogik woko ci Aron odok cen bot Moses i dog Kema me Rwate.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s1">Odo pa Aron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Lok ki jo Icrael ci igam odo ki botgi, odo acel pi dog ot pa kwarogi ki acel acel. Gam ki bot lutel wigi ducu, ma oporo dog odi pa kwarigi, odo ducu apar wiye aryo. Ci i coo nying dano acel acel ikom odoone. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Coo nying Aron ikom odo pa likwayo pa Levi. Pien odo bibedo acel pi dog ot acel acel pa kwarigi. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Ibicibogi i Kema me Rwate inyim Canduk lok me Caden kama an arwate iye ki wun. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Ci odo pa dano ma abiyero en aye bilot. Meno aye abinongo iye yo me juku jo Icrael ma gin bedo ka ngur ikomani.” <verse eid="NUM 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Moses oloko ki jo Icrael, ci lutel wigi ducu gukelo odoogi bote, odo acel pi lutel wigi ki acel acel, ma oporo wel odi pa kwarigi, odo apar wiye aryo; odo pa Aron bene onongo tye ikin odoogi. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Ci Moses ocibo odo ducu inyim Rwot i Kema lok me caden.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 9:4">Ibru 9:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Orwone Moses odonyo i kema lok me caden; ci, nen, odo pa Aron ma ocung pi dog ot pa Levi ni aye olot woko, okico ki obolo olang, oturu onyako nyig yaa ma ocek. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Ka Moses okelo odo ducu nia ki inyim Rwot, otero bot jo Icrael ducu, guneno, ci dano acel acel okwanyo odoone. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Dwok odo pa Aron inyim Canduk lok me Caden kakare, wek kigwok obed lanyut pi jo mujemo, wek ijuk ngurgi atata ikomani, ogik woko, wek to pe opot ikomgi.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Ci Moses otimo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Ci jo Icrael guwaco bot Moses ni, “Nen ba, watum woko do, keckom opoto ikomwa omiyo wato, watum woko. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Nen jo ducu ma gibino cok ki kema pa Rwot, gito woko. Wan ducu bene myero wato woko bo?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s1">Tic pa Ajwaki ki pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Aron ni, “In ki awobeni kacel ki jo me ot pa kwarowu wubitingo alii me bal pi Kabedo Maleng, dok in kacel ki awobeni wubitingo alii me bal pi ticwu me bedo ajwaki. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />In ibikelo utmegini ma i kaka pa Levi cok kacel kwedi, ma en aye kaka pa woru, wek guribe kwedi, gukonyi ma nongo in ki awobeni wutye katic inyim Kema lok me Caden. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Gin gibibedo kwedwu i dog ticwu, dok gibitiyo tic ducu mamite i kema; ento pe gibicito cok ikom jami ducu ma i Kabedo Maleng, pe gibinyiko cok ki keno tyer, wek pe to opot ikom gin ki wun. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Gin binywako tic kwedwu i Kema me Rwate pi tic ducu ma i Kema; pe ngat mukene mo bibino cok botwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Wun wubitiyo tic ma i Kabedo Maleng, ki tic ikom keno tyer, wek kiniga pa Rwot pe dok opot ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Nen, dong akwanyo utmegiwu, gin Lulevi, ki ikin jo Icrael; gin gitye macalo mot ma kimiyowu, gin aye jo ma kimiyo bot Rwot pi tiyo tic i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />In ki awobeni keken aye wubitiyo ticwu me bedo ajwaki ilok ducu ma kemo kom keno tyer nyo matye i tyelo ma bongo kicika oumuni. Amiyowu tic me bedo ajwakina macalo mot ma amiyo botwu. Ka ngat mo ata ma pe kiyero obino cok, kibineke woko.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dul cam ma kimiyo ki ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Rwot dok owaco bot Aron ni, “Nen, dong atyeko miyo i cingi gityer ducu ma kimiyo bota, jami maleng ducu ma jo Icrael gikelo. Atyeko miyogi gubed wang wat ma tung boti, ki bot awobeni me bedo wang wat ma myero kimii botgi kare ducu. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Magi aye bibedo meri ki ikom jami maleng makato ducu ma pe kiwango ki mac: gityer ducu ma jo Icrael gimiyo bota, gityer me moko kwon ducu, gitum me bal ducu, gitum me tingo alii ducu; gibibedo maleng makato piri ki pi awobeni. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Wubicamo ki i kabedo mo maleng makato; cowu ducu gitwero camo; pien tye maleng pirwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />Man bene mewu: gin ducu ma kikwanyo ki ikom motgi me bedo gityer akwata; atyeko miyogi botwu ki bot awobewu ki anyirawu obed wang watwu me kare ducu. Jo ducu ma i odi ma gulonye gitwero camo. <verse eid="NUM 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />Moo mabecone ducu, pig olok mabecone ducu ki bel mabere ducu, man gin mot ma kimiyo bot Rwot me wi mwaka dong amiyo botwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Cam ducu mukwongo cek i lobogi ma kikelo bot Rwot bibedo mewu; dano ducu ma i odi ma olonye twero camo.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:28">Lev 27:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gin ducu ma i Icrael ma kidyero i cing Rwot bibedo mewu.<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />Lutino ducu ma kikwongo nywalogi, kadi bed pa dano nyo pa lee, ma kityero bot Rwot bibedo mewu. Ento lutino kayo ducu pa dano kibikokogi akoka ki lim, ki lutino kayo pa lee ma keni ma pe kicamo bene kibikokogi akoka. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Kibikokogi ka ditogi dong romo dwe acel. Wel me kokogi kibimoko obed cekel me ryal abic, kun lubu wel ma kimoko. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Ento latin kayo pa dyang nyo pa romo nyo pa dyel pe kibikoko; pien gin leng. Ibikiro remogi ikom keno tyer, dok ibiwango dwologi obed gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Ringogi bibedo mewu, macalo gok ma kikwato ki em ma lacuc bene mewu. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Gityer maleng ducu ma jo Icrael gimiyo bot Rwot dong amiyo botwu ki bot awobewu ki anyirawu me bedo pok ma tung botwu me nino ducu. Man aye gicike ma amoko matwal ki in ki likwayu ducu.” <verse eid="NUM 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Rwot dok owaco bot Aron ni, “Pe wubilimo ginaleya mo nyo dul lobo mo ikin jo Icrael; an kikoma aye abedo ginaleyawu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dul cam ma kimiyo ki Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lev 27:30-33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">Nwo 14:22-29</ref></char>
    </note>Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Bot Lulevi atyeko miyogi dul acel me apar ikom jami pa jo Icrael me bedo meggi pi culu ticgi ma gitiyo, i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Dok nia tin jo Icrael pe gibinyiko cok ki Kema me Rwate, wek pe gunong bal ma kelogi to. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Ento Lulevi keken aye gibitiyo tic ma i Kema me Rwate, gin aye gibibedo lubalo ka gin mo oroce iye. Man bibedo cik matwal nio wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu; dok pe gibileyo dul lobo mo ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Pien dul acel me apar ma a ki bot jo Icrael, ma kimiyo obed gityer bot Rwot, atyeko miyo bot Lulevi me ginaleyagi; ma omiyo aloko ikomgi ni, pe gibibedo ki dul lobo mo me aleyagi ikin jo Icrael.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dul acel me apar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />“Dok iwac bot Lulevi ni, ‘Ka wugamo dul acel me apar ki bot jo Icrael, ma atyeko miyo botwu obed mewu, wun dok wubimiyo gityer ma a ki iye bot Rwot, dul acel me apar ki ikom dul acel me apar ma kikelo botwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Gityerwu man kibikwano pirwu macalo wumiyo ki ikom ngano ma wudino ki ikom kongo olok ma oa ki i nyig olokwu ma wubiyo. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Kitmeno wun bene wubimiyo gityer bot Rwot ki ikom dul acel me apar ducu ma wubigamo ki bot jo Icrael; wubikwanyo gityer pa Rwot ki ikome, wumiyo bot ajwaka Aron. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Mot ducu ma kimiyo botwu en aye wubikwanyo iye gityer ducu ma myero bot Rwot, ki mabecone ducu, ci bedo gin ma kikwero wek obed maleng.’ <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Ma omiyo ibiwaco bot Lulevi ni, ‘Ka dong wutyero mabecone woko, ci mudonge bibedo mewu macalo oa ki i laro dino nganowu nyo i kabiyo nyig olokwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Wutwero camo i kabedo ducu, wun ki jo ma i odiwu; pien en aye kiculuwu kwede pi ticwu i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Pe wubinongo iye bal mo, teke wutyeko kwanyo mabecone pi gityer. Ento pe wupyed jami maleng ma jo Icrael gimiyo, wek pe wuto.’”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s1">Buru roya makwar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Man aye cik ma An a Rwot aye aciko. Wac bot jo Icrael ni gukeli roya makwar mabere ma kome pe kimwonyo, ma peya kitiyo kwede. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Ibimiyo bot ajwaka Eleajar ci kibitero woko inge gony, ka dong kibineko inyim Eleajar. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Ajwaka Eleajar bigwelo remone ki nyig cinge, ci kiro remone tyen abiro mukemo nyim Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Kibiwango kom roya woko ma kun en neno; pyene, ringone, remone ki cete, kibiwangone ducu. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Dok ajwaka bikwanyo yat cedar ki anyero ki uci makwar ci bibologi i dye mac me wango ringo royani. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Ka dok ajwaka pa Lubanga bilwoko bongine, ki lwoko kome, ka dong lacen bidok i gony; ento ajwaka pa Lubanga bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Ngat ma owango royani bene bilwoko bongine, lwoko kome, ci bene bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:13">Ibru 9:13</ref></char></note>Ci dano mo ma olonye, ma pe kome kikeni aye bijobo buru royani, ci biketo i kabedo mo ma olony, woko ki inge gony. Kibikano pi lwak jo Icrael pi yubu pii me lwoko kwer; meno kibitimo pi kwanyo bal. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Ngat ma ojobo buru bene bilwoko bongine ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. Man bibedo cik matwal bot jo Icrael ki bot lurok ma bedo ikin gi.”<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gudu kom dano ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Jo ma ogudu kom dano mo ma oto gibedo keni pi nino abiro. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Gin bilonye keken gi ki pii me lwoko kwer inino me adeke ki me abirone, ci miyo gibedo ma olony. Ento ka pe gulonye keken gi inino me adeke ki me abirone, ci pe dong gibedo ma olony. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Jo ducu ma ogudu kom dano ma oto, ma pe gulonye nongo gitye keni pien pii me lonye pe kionyo ikomgi. Gin nongo gubalo kema pa Rwot, pimeno pe dong kibikwanogi ikin jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />Ka dano oto i kemawu mo cik tye kit man: dano ducu ma gin bedo i kema kama dano meno oto iye, ki dano acel acel ma donyo i kema, gibedo keni pi nino abiro. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Agulu ki atabogu ducu ma i kema ma pe kiumu wigi bedo keni. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Kit dano mo keken ka tye i tim ce ogudu kom dano ma kineko ki pala lucwan, nyo kom dano mo ma oto kene, nyo cogo dano mo, nyo lyel ma kiyiko iye dano, bibedo keni pi nino abiro.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />Pi lonyo dano ma odoko keni kitmeno, kibikwanyo buru ki buru roya mayam kineko me kwanyo bal, kibiketo i otako, ci kimedo iye pii mamol. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Pi ngat ma oto i kema, dano ma olonye bikwanyo anyero ci lutu i pii meno, ka dong kiro kema ki ikom jami ducu matye iye, ki ikom dano ducu ma onongo gitye i kema. Kibitimo kitmeno bene pi ngat ma ogudu cogo dano nyo ma ogudu kom dano ma kineko nyo ma oto kene, nyo ma ogudu lyel ma kiyiko iye dano. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Dano ma olony bikiro pii meno ikom dano makeni inino me adeke ki inino me abirone. En bilonyo dano makeni ni inino me abirone, dok dano meno bilwoko bongine, lwoko kome, ci otyeno en doko ma olony.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Jo ducu ma odoko keni, ma pe gulonye gibedo keni, pien pii me lonye peya kionyo ikomgi. Gin gubalo kema pa Rwot, pimeno pe kibikwanogi ikin jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Meno bibedo cik botwu matwal. Ngat ma okiro pii me lwoko kwer bilwoko bongine; ki ngat mo ma ogudu pii me lwoko kwer bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Gin ducu ma dano ma kenini ogudu bibedo keni; ngat ma ogudu jami meno bene bibedo keni nio wa otyeno.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pii ma oa i pata got</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Nia 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Jo Icrael ki lwakgi ducu guo i tim Jin i dwe mukwongo, ci gutiro i Kadec, gubedo iye. Miriam oto, ka kiyike bene ki kenyo.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Pii onongo peke me amata pa lwak, ci gucoke kacel ikom Moses ki Aron. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Gin gukeco ikom Moses kun giwaco ni, “Kono yam wato woko ikare ma utmegiwa guto inyim Rwot, kono ber. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Pingo nene ikelo lwak pa Rwot i tim ata kany, wek wato woko, wan kacel ki leewa? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Pingo nene imiyo waa woko ki i Ejipt, ikelowa i kabedo man maraci? Kabedo ma pe ceko ngano, kadi wa oduru nyo olok nyo pomegranat; pii mo bene peke me amata.” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Ci Moses ki Aron gua woko ki inyim lwak, gucito i dogola Kema me Rwate, gupoto piny aryeba ic ki cwercwiny. Ci deyo pa Rwot onen botgi. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Kwany odo ki inyim Canduk lok me Caden, ci igur lwak kacel, wun ki omeru Aron, ci iwac ki pata got ki inyim lwak ni wek piine okati woko. Kitmeno ibikelo pii pirgi nia ki i pata got wek lwak gumati, ki leegi bene.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ci Moses okwanyo odo ki inyim Rwot kit macalo ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Moses ki Aron gucoko lwak kacel inyim pata got, ci Moses owaco botgi ni, “Dong wuwiny ba, wun lujemoni. Wumito ni wan wakel pii nia ki ipata got man pirwu?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Ci Moses oilo odo malo, ogoyo pata got ki odoone tyen aryo kulu; ci pii ocore limayi, lwak gumato, ki leegi makwo bene.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Ento Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, “Pien wun pe wuye an, kun pe wunyutu ki inyim jo Icrael ni an aleng, pimeno wun pe dong wubitero lwak man i lobo ma abimiyo botgini.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Man en aye pii me Meriba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="fk">Meriba </char> teloke ni Akeca. </note> kama jo Icrael gukeco iye ikom Rwot ci en onyute kene ni eleng.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Edom gukwero ni jo Icrael pe owok ki i lobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Moses ocwalo lukwena ocito bot rwot me Edom nia ki i Kadec ci gin owaco ni, “Omeru Icrael owaco kuman ni in ingeyo can madito ducu ma opoto ikomwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Kit mayam kwariwa guwoto kwede i Ejipt, ma wabedo i Ejipt pi kare malac, ci jo Ejipt gutimowa magwa, wan ki kwariwa ducu. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Ka yam wakok bot Rwot, ci en owinyo dwonwa, ka ocwalo lamalaika, okwanyowa woko ki i Ejipt. Ci kombedi dong watye i Kadec, i taun madong cok ki wang lobowu. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Ber wuwek wawok ki i lobowu. Pe wabingak wawok ki i poto mo, nyo i poto olok, pe wabimato pii ma iwang it. Wabimol ma walubu gudu madit pa Rwot, pe wabingak wadok tung acam nyo tung acuc, nio ka wawok wakato wang lobowu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Ento jo Edom guwaco ni, “Pe wubiwok ki i lobowa, ka wutemo ci miyo wan aye wabino ikomwu ki pala lucwan.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Ci jo Icrael gugamo ni, “Wabiwok igudu madit keken. Ka wamato piiwu mo, wan nyo leewa makwo, wabiculu wange. Wek wawok wakat ki tyenwa keken, lok mo mukene peke.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Ento jo Edom dok guwaco ni, “Pe wubiwok ki i lobowa.” Ci jo Edom gubino kalweny ikomgi ki lwak co mapol ki mony matek. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Kitmeno jo Edom gukwero miyo jo Icrael me kato kun giwok ki i lobogi; omiyo jo Icrael gua guloke, guceyo yoo mukene.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aron oto iwi got Kor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Lwak jo Icrael ducu gua ki Kadec, gubino ite got Kor. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ite got Kor, iwang lobo Edom ni, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Aron aye dong bito, bidok bot lutugi; en pe bidonyo i lobo ma amiyo bot jo Icrael, pien yam wujemo ikom cika i dog pii me Meriba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Ter Aron ki wode Eleajar, icit kwedgi malo iwi got Kor, <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />iluny bongo tic pa Aron ducu ki ikome, ci iruk ki wode Eleajar, pien Aron dong bidok bot lutugi, en bito ki kunu.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Moses otiyo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede. Guito malo iwi got Kor kun lwak ducu neno. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:29">Nia 29:29</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:38">Wel 33:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:6">Nwo 10:6</ref></char></note>Ci Moses olunyu bongo tic pa Aron woko ducu, ci oruku kwede wode Eleajar. Aron oto woko ki kunu iwi got. Lacen Moses ki Eleajar gulor woko piny ki iwi got. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Ka lwak jo Icrael ducu guneno ni Aron dong oto, ci gin gukumu pire pi nino pyere adek.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Kanaan gulwenyo ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 33:40">Wel 33:40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka rwot me Arad, ma en Lakanaan ma bedo i Negeb, owinyo ni jo Icrael gitye kabino ki i yoo Atarim, ci olwenyo ikomgi, ci oyako jo mogo woko ki ikin gi. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Ci jo Icrael gukwongo kwong bot Rwot kun giwaco ni, “Ka ibimiyo jo man i cingwa ada, ci wan wabidyerogi i cingi, wabijwero taun gi madito woko liweng.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Ci Rwot owinyo lega pa jo Icrael, omiyo guloyo Lukanaan, gudyerogi i cing Rwot kacel ki taun gi madito. Gujwero woko; ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni Korma.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cal twol ma kiteto ki mola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 2:1">Nwo 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Icrael gua ki ite got Kor, gucako lubu yoo ma cito i Nam Makwar, kun girabo lobo Edom. Ci cwiny dano obale woko ikare ma gin tye i yo. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:9">1 Kor 10:9</ref></char></note>Ci gucako loko lok marac ikom Lubanga ki ikom Moses kun giwaco ni, “Pingo wukwanyowa woko ki i Ejipt wek wato i tim? Cam peke, pii bene peke, cwinywa ocido woko ki cam ma konye pekeni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Ci Rwot ocwalo twol ma kwirgi kec ikom lwak, ci gucako tongo dano; jo Icrael oto mapol. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Dano gubino bot Moses, ci guwaco ni, “Dong watyeko balo, pien waloko lok akeca ikom Rwot ki ikomi. Leg Rwot wek okwany twol woko ki ikinwa.” Ci Moses olego pi lwak. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, “Tet cal twol ma kwire keci, ci iket ingab malo ikom tal; ci dano ducu ma twol otongo, ka oneno kome, ci bedo kwo.” <figure style="fig" alt="An iimage of a poisonous snake on a pole" file="CO00863B.TIF" size="col" loc="21:8" copy="David Cook" ref="21:8">Cal twol ma kwire kec ma kiketo ikom tal</figure> <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Luk 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jon 3:14</ref></char></note>Kitmeno Moses oteto cal twol mola, ongabo malo iwi tal; ci ka twol otongo dano mo en neno kom cal twol mola, ci kwo.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gurabo lobo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Jo Icrael gucako wot, ci gugony i Obot. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Dok gua woko ki i Obot, ci gugony i Iye-Abarim, i tim ma okemo Moab, tung kunyango. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Ka dok gua ki kunu, gumedo ki wot, ci gugony i nota me Jered. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Gua ki kunu, gumedo wot, ci gugony loka kulu Arnon, matye i dye tim, ma oa wa iwang lobo pa jo Amor, Arnon en aye wang lobo pa jo Moab, ma ikin Moab ki jo Amor. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />En aye ma omiyo kitito pi kabedo magi i Buk me Lweny pa Rwot ni, “Wakeb ma i Cupa, ki nota me Arnon ducu, <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />ki lung me nota mapol ma oyare nio wa ikabedo ma kilwongo ni Ar, ma ojenge wa iwang lobo me Moab.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Gua ki kunu, gubino i Beer.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="fk">Beer </char> te loke ni, wang it.</note> En aye wang it mayam Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, “Cok lwak kacel, wek amii pii botgi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Ikare meno jo Icrael guwero wer man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">“Gunye malo, in wang it!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">Wakori ki wer!<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Man wang it ma luker gukwinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">ma gin twoni pa lwak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">gugolo matut ki tal ker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">ki odoogi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Ka dok gua i dye tim, gucito i Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />nia i Matana gucito Nakaliel, ki nia ki kunu gucito Bamot. <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />Nia ki kunu gucito i nota ma otonge i lobo Moab, ite lacol got Piciga, ma neno piny tung tim aroo.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guloyo Cikon rwot pa jo Amor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Nwo 2:26—3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Jo Icrael gucwalo lukwena bot Cikon, rwot pa jo Amor, ma guwaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Ber iwek wawok ki i lobowu, pe wabingak wawok ki i poto mo, nyo i poto olok, pe wabimato pii ma iwang it. Wabimol ma walubu gudu pa Rwot maditi nio ka wawok wakato wang lobowu.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Ento Cikon pe oye ni jo Icrael guwok ki i lobone. Ocoko jone ducu, ogurugi kacel, ci ocito kalweny ikom jo Icrael i tim. Ka guo i Jakaj, ci gucako lweny ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Ento jo Icrael guneko jone mapol ki pala lucwan, ci gucamo lobogi cake ki i kulu Arnon nio kwede wa i Jajer matye iwang lobo pa jo Ammon. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Jo Icrael gumako taun madito ducu pa jo Amor, ci gucako bedo iye, i Kecbon ki i taun matino ducu ma i ngete. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Kecbon onongo obedo taun madit ma gangkal pa Cikon rwot pa jo Arnon tye iye. Cikon yam con kong olwenyo ikom rwot pa jo Moab ci okwanyo lobone woko ducu ki i cinge nio wa i Arnon. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Ma omiyo lurut wer lwod guwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Wubin i Kecbon, i gangkal pa Cikon!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">Wek kiger odoco, kiyub ocung matek.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Pien mony pa Cikon yam oa ki i taun madit me Kecbon ci obalo piny macalo mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">ma lyel matek ci obalo Ar taun madit pa jo Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">ki gin ducu matye iwi godi me Arnon.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Can madwong opoto ikomi, in Moab!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Wuto wutum woko do, wun lwak pa Kemoc!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Jok Kemoc omiyo awobene guringo gularo komgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">oweko anyirane kiyako kitero i cing Cikon rwot pa jo Amor.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Kitmeno kityeko likwayogi woko nia ki i Kecbon nio wa i Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Wajwero piny woko nio ka mac omede naka wa i Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guloyo Og rwot me Bacan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:1-11">Nwo 3:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gubedo i lobo pa jo Amor. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Ka dok Moses ocwalo dano ka roto yoo maber ma omyero kimak ki Jajer. Gumako taun gi matino ma i ngete, ci guryemo jo Amor ma gibedo kunu. <verse eid="NUM 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Ka guloke, gudok tung Bacan. Ci Og rwot me Bacan ocore kalweny ikomgi, en ki lwake ducu, ci lweny ogeto i Edrei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Ento Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Pe ilwore; pien atyeko miyo en i cingi, en ki lwake ducu, ki lobogi bene. Ibitimo en kit ma itimo Cikon rwot pa jo Amor mayam obedo Kecbon.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Kitmeno jo Icrael guneko Og ki awobene ducu, gujwero lwake ducu ma ngat acel mo pe odong ma obwot makwo; ci gucamo lobogi woko.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s1">Balak ocwalo lukwena kalwongo Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Jo Icrael dok gucako wot ci guguru kemagi i lobo aroo me Moab loka Jordan mukemo Jeriko. <verse eid="NUM 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Balak wod pa Jipor oneno gin ducu ma jo Icrael gutimo ikom jo Amor. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />En kacel ki jo Moab gubedo ki lworo madwong ikom jo Icrael, pien onongo gipol mada, ma omiyo lworo oloco kom jo Moab woko. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Ci jo Moab owaco ki ludongo pa jo Midian ni, “Lwak jo man gibijwerowa woko kacel ki gin ducu ma orumuwa, macalo twon dyang ma camo lum ki i bar tyeko woko.” Pimeno Balak wod pa Jipor ma onongo obedo rwot me Moab ikare meno, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8">Wel 31:8</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15-16">2 Pet 2:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:11">Jud 11</ref></char></note>ocwalo lukwena bot Balaam wod pa Beor i Petor macok ki kulu Euprate i lobo Amau ka lwonge kun waco ni, “Nen, rok mo obino ma oa ki i Ejipt, oumu lobo woko lipuk; kombedi dong gitye ma okemo an. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Tim ber ibin icen jo meno woko pira, pien gitek makato an woko. Gwok onyo miyo abitwero loyogi ci aryemogi woko ki i lobo kany; pien angeyo ni ngat ma ilego gum ikome, kome bedo gum, ki ngat ma iceno nongo dong kiceno.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Kitmeno ludongo me Moab ki ludongo me Midian guwoto ki lim me tyet i cinggi. Gin gucito bot Balaam, ci gutite kwena ma Balak ocwalo. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Ci Balaam owaco ki gin ni, “Tin wubut kany, ci abidwoko lok botwu gin ma Rwot biloko bota.” Kitmeno ludito pa jo Moab gubedo bot Balaam. <verse eid="NUM 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Ci Lubanga obino bot Balaam, owaco ni, “Jo mene ma gin tye boti ni?” <verse eid="NUM 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Ci Balaam owaco ki Lubanga ni, “Balak wod pa Jipor, ma rwot me Moab, en aye ocwala kwena ma kun waco ni, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‘Nen, rok mo obino ma oa ki i Ejipt, ma oumu lobo woko lipuk. Tim ber ibin wek icen jo meno woko pira; miyo gwok onyo abitwero lweny kwedgi ci aryemogi woko.’” <verse eid="NUM 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Ento Lubanga owaco ki Balaam ni, “In pe ibiwot kwedgi; pe ibiceno jo meno, pien gin jo ma kimiyogi gum wacon.” <verse eid="NUM 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Ka Balaam oa malo odiko, ci owaco ki ludito pa Balak ni, “Wudok giwu i lobowu; pien Rwot otyeko kwero ni pe acit kwedwu.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Ma omiyo ludito pa jo Moab gua gudok bot Balak, guwaco ni. “Balaam okwero bino kwedwa woko.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Ento Balak dok omede ki cwalo ludito mapol, ki dano ma gigene makato jo ma okwongo ca. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Gin gucito bot Balaam, guwaco bote ni, “Balak wod pa Jipor owaco kuman ni, ‘Pe iwek gin mo ogengi bino bota; <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />pien ada abiketi ideyo madit, dok gin ducu ma ibiwaca abitiyo.’” <verse eid="NUM 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Ento Balaam odok iye ki lutic pa Balak ni, “Kadi bed Balak onongo omiya ryal ki jabu ducu ma i ode, pe atwero kalo wi cik pa Rwot Lubangana pi tiyo gin mo ma tidi nyo madit. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Dong alegowu ni wun bene tin wubed kany wek ange gin ma Rwot dok biwaca.” <verse eid="NUM 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ci Lubanga obino bot Balaam i dyewor meno owaco bote ni, “Ka jo meno obino kalwongi, ci ia malo icit kwedgi ento gin ma aciko boti aye ibitiyone.”<verse eid="NUM 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam ki kanane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Kitmeno Balaam oa malo odiko con, otweyo del kom kanane, ocito ki ludito pa jo Moab. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Ento kiniga omako Lubanga pi citone; ci lamalaika pa Rwot ocung woko i yoo macalo lameroke. Balaam onongo oito iwi kana, ki lutice aryo onongo gin tye kwede. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Ka kana oneno lamalaika pa Rwot kun ocung i dye gudu, kun nongo owoto pala lucwane, omako i cinge, ci kana oloke, oa woko ki i gudu, ocito i poto. Balaam ogoyo kana omiyo odok woko i yoo. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Ci lamalaika dok ocung i yoo kamading ma ikin poto olok ma kigengo ki cel got tungi ki tungi. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Ka dok kana oneno lamalaika pa Rwot, ci oyoke ki cel got, odiyo tyen Balaam ikom cel, omiyo en dok ogoye aye. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Ka dok lamalaika pa Rwot omede ki wot anyim ci ocung i apiding ma kaweyo peke tung lacuc nyo tung lacam. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Ka kana oneno lamalaika pa Rwot, obutu woko piny katyen Balaam, ci kiniga omako Balaam, ogoyo kana ki odoone. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Ka dong Rwot oyabo dog kana ci owaco bot Balaam ni, “An atimo gin ango ikomi ma omiyo igoya tyen adek kuluni?” <verse eid="NUM 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Ci Balaam owaco ki kana ni, “Pien ibedo kanywara. Kono onongo atye ki pala i cinga, kono aneki kwede woko cut.” <verse eid="NUM 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Ci kana owaco ki Balaam ni, “An pe akanani ma ibedo ikoma kare me kwoni ducu nio wa onyo? Onongo yam kong anyebe katimo kit man ikomi?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Pe.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Lacen Rwot oyabo wang Balaam, ci oneno lamalaika pa Rwot ka ocung i dye yoo ma omako pala lucwan i cinge; ci Balaam okulu wiye piny, opoto piny aryeba cwiny. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Lamalaika pa Rwot owaco bote ni, “Pingo igoyo kanani tyen adek kulu? Nen, an abino anyim ka juki, pien woti akakani pe oyomo cwinya. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Kana onena ci oloke oa woko ki inyima tyen adek kulu. Kono en pe onongo oloke oa woko ki bota, kono onongo dong aneki woko tin ada, kun aweko en makwo.” <verse eid="NUM 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Ci Balaam owaco bot lamalaika pa Rwot ni, “Dong abalo, pien onongo pe angeyo ni icung i yoo pi lweny ikoma. Piman kace atime marac ma pe ipwoyo wota man, ci abidok gira cen ki ngeya.” <verse eid="NUM 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Ento lamalaika pa Rwot ogamo dog Balaam ni, “In dong icit ki jo meno; ento gin ma aciki aye ibiloko.” Pimeno Balaam omede ki wot kacel ki ludito pa Balak.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balak ojolo Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Ka Balak owinyo ni Balaam dong obino, ci ocito karomo kwede i Ar taun madit me Moab ma iwang lobo ma kulu Arnon opoko. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Ci Balak owaco bot Balaam ni. “An yam pe acwalo kwena ka lwongi? Pingo pe nene ibino bota? Onongo itamoni pe atwero keto deyo ikomi?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Ci Balaam ogamo ni, “Nen dong abino boti. Kombedi an atye ki twero ango me loko gin mo boti? Lok ma Rwot biketo idoga, en aye myero aloki.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Balaam ocito gin ki Balak, ci gucito i Kiriat-kujot. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Ka Balak ocako tumu twoni ki romi opoko ringo ocwalo bot Balaam ki ludito mayam gitye kwede.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi pa Balaam mukwongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Orwone Balak otero Balaam ocito kwede malo wa i Bamot-Baal, ci Balaam oneno jo Icrael ma gitye cok ki kunu.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balaam owaco bot Balak ni, “Ber icana keno tyer abiro kany, ci ikela twoni abiro ki romi bene abiro.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balak otiyo kit ma Balaam ocikoni; ci Balak ki Balaam gubedo katyero twon acel ki nyok romo acel iwi keno tyer ki acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Ci Balaam owaco bot Balak ni, “Cung kany inget gitum awangani, ci an abicito kunu. Gwok onyo Rwot bibino ka rwate kweda, ci gin ducu ma en binyuta abitito ki in.” Ci ocito malo iwi got kama yadi pe iye.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Ci Lubanga orwate ki Balaam. Balaam owaco bote ni, “Dong atyeko yubu keno tyer abiro, dok atyero twon acel ki nyok romo acel iwi keno tyer ki acel acel.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Ci Rwot oketo loke i dog Balaam kun waco bote ni, “Dok cen bot Balak ci iwace kit man.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balam odok cen ci onongo Balak pud ocung kanget gitum awangane kacel ki ludito pa jo Moab ducu. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balaam ocako loke kun loko macalo lanebi. Owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balak okela ki i Aram,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">rwot me Moab ooma ki iwi godi matye tung kunyango kun waconi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Bin wek icena jo pa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">Bin wek icena jo Icrael!’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Ento abiceno ningning jo ma Lubanga pe oceno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Acenogi ningning ka Rwot pe ocenogi?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Anenogi ki iwi pata got mabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">abedo kanenogi ki iwi cere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Nen, gin lwak ma gibedo kaken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">pe giribe kacel ki rok mukene ducu.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Anga ma kwano jo pa Yakobo ma gipol macalo apwani?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Anga ma kwano jo Icrael ma gipol mada kit man ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Wek an ato kit to pa joni ma kitgi atiri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Agiki kwona obed macalo meggi!”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Ci Balak owaco ki Balaam ni, “Gin ango ma dong itimo tung bota? Akeli kany kaceno lumeroka, ci nen, in dok ilamo gum ikomgi keken.” <verse eid="NUM 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Ento Balaam odok iye ni, “Omyero an pe agwoke kaloko gin ma Rwot oketo idoga?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi me aryo pa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Balak dok owaco bote ni, “Bin dong kweda i kabedo mukene kama iromo nenogi iye. Ibineno jo ma gitye cok keken, pe ibinenogi ducu; ci icengi pira ki kunu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Ci otere i poto pa Jopim wa i lacol got Piciga. Ocano keno tyer abiro kunu, ci otyero twon acel ki nyok romo acel iwi keno tyer ki acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Ci Balaam owaco bot Balak ni, “Cung kany kanget gitum awangani, kun an arwate ki Rwot kuca.” <verse eid="NUM 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Ci Rwot orwate ki Balaam, oketo lok idoge kun waco ni, “Dok cen bot Balak, ci iwace kit man.” <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Ci Balaam odok bote ci onongo Balak pud ocung kanget gitum awangane ki ludito pa jo Moab kacel kwede. Balak openye ni, “Rwot dong oloko ningo?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Balaam ocako loke kun loko macalo lanebi. Owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“A malo, Balak, ci iwiny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">winy an ya, in wod pa Jipor.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Lubanga pe dano, matwero loko goba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Lubanga pe wod pa dano, maloko tame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Ka dong owaco lok mo, ci pe bitiyone?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Ka en oloko, ci pe cobe kakare?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Nen ya, alimo cik me miyo gum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:20">ka Lubanga omiyo gum, pe atwero dwokone cen.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Pe aneno can mo ma bipoto ikom Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">pe aneno aroma mo ma bibedo bot jo Icrael.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">Rwot Lubangagi tye kwedgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">awinyo ka gin dange kajolo rwotgi.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Lubanga okwanyogi ki i Ejipt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:22">kerone calo kero pa jubi.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Kit jok mo peke maloko can ikom Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">kit gin tyet mo peke ma mako kom Icrael.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Koni dong gibiwaco lok ikom Yakobo ki Icrael ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Lubanga otimo gin madit kuman!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Nen lwak meno! Gin a malo macalo min labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">gitinge macalo labwor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">ma pe butu piny nio ka omwodo lee ma omako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">ci mato remo pa gin ma onekoni.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Ci Balak owaco bot Balaam ni, “Ka pe iye cenogi, ci omyero pe dok ilam gum ikomgi aye.” <verse eid="NUM 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Ento Balaam odok iye ki Balak ni, “Yam pe awaco boti ni, ‘Gin ducu ma Rwot ocika kwede, meno aye myero atim?’” <verse eid="NUM 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Ci Balak owaco bot Balaam ni, “Kong dok ibin, wek ateri i kabedo mukene; gwok Lubanga biye ni icengi ki kunu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Balak dok otero Balaam iwi lacol got Peor ma neno piny tung tim aroo. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Ci Balaam owaco bot Balak ni, “Cana bene keno tyer abiro kany, ikela twoni abiro ki nyogi romi abiro.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balak otiyo kit ma Balaam owaconi, ci otyero twon acel ki nyok romo acel iwi keno tyer ki acel acel.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi me adek pa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Balaam, onongo dong oniang ni Rwot mito miyo gum ikom jo Icrael, ma omiyo pe dok ocito kayenyo tyet kit ma onongo ocito ikare mukeneni, ento oloko wange oneno tung tim. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Ka Balaam oilo wange malo, ci oneno jo Icrael ma gin oguru kemagi kaka ki kaka. Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ikome, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />ci ocako loke kun loko macalo lanebi. En owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">“Man lok pa Balaam wod pa Beor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">lok pa twon laco ma wange dong kiyabo,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />lok pa ngat ma winyo gin ma Lubanga waco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:4">ki ma neno gin ma Won Twer Ducu nyutu bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:4">ma ryebe piny inyime ento wange bedo twolo.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Kemawu nen maber kuman, wun jo pa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:5">gonywu ber kuman, wun jo Icrael!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Nen calo nota ma oryene mabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">macalo poti ma kipuru inget kulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">cal ki yadi ma ngwece kur ma Rwot opito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">nyo yadi cedar ma obake inget pii.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Pii bipong libic i agulugi kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">likwayogi bibedo rom ki pii mamol madwong;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">rwotgi bibedo dit makato Agag,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">kibiketo deyo mamalo mada ikom kere.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Lubanga ma kerone calo kero pa jubi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">okwanyogi woko ki i Ejipt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Icrael bicamo lurok ma lukwore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">bituru cogogi, ngido matinotino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">bicelogi pil ki aterone.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aca 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:9">49:9</ref></char>
    </note> En nyongo piny, butu calo labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">macalo min labwor; anga ma bituge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">Gum obed ikom dano ducu ma bilamo gum ikom Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">cen opot ikom dano ducu ma bicene.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Ci kiniga omako Balak matek ikom Balaam, ci odongo cinge kekene kun waco bot Balaam ni, “Alwongi kaceno lumeroka, ento in dong ilego gum ikomgi odoko tyen adek kulu. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Pimeno in dong iring woko oyot idok dong gang. Yam awaco ni abiketo deyo ikomi ada, ento Rwot dong ogengi woko ka limo deyo mo ki bota.” <verse eid="NUM 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balaam ogamo dog Balak, kun waco ni, “Yam atito ki lukwenani mayam icwalogi bota ni, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />‘Kadi bed Balak omiya ryal ki jabu ducu ma i ode, pe atwero turu cik pa Rwot pi timo gin mo kadi ber onyo kadi rac kit ma an aye amito; gin ma Rwot biwaco keken aye abiwaco.’”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me nebi pa Balaam me agikine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Lacen Balaam owaco bot Balak ni, “Kombedi, nen, an dong abidok woko bot lutuwa. Bin wek kong amii inge gin ma jo me rok man bitimo ikom joni ikare matye anyim.” <verse eid="NUM 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Ci ocako loke kun loko macalo lanebi, kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">“Man lok pa Balaam wod pa Beor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">lok pa twon laco ma wange dong kiyabo,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />lok pa ngat ma winyo gin ma Lubanga owaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">ngat matye ki ngec ma oa ki bot En Mamalo Twal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">ma neno gin ma Won Twer Ducu nyutu bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">kun ryebe piny inyime ento wange bedo twolo.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Anene, ento pe kombedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">anene, ento pe tye cok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Lakalatwe bibino kun a ki bot Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">odo ker bia ki i Icrael;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">bityero tur nyim jo Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">bituru wi jo ducu ma gimaro woo me lweny.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />En bimayo lobo pa jo Edom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">Jo Ceir ma lukwore en bimayo lobo ki botgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">kun jo Icrael gitye kalweny ki tek.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Jo pa Yakobo gibiloyo loc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:19">jo ma obwot ki i gang pa jo Moab kibinekogi woko liweng.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Ka dok oneno tung bot jo Amalek, Balaam oloko macalo lanebi kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Jo Amalek yam gutelo wi rok mukene ducu, ento i agiki kibityekogi woko matwal.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Dok oneno tung bot jo Kenit, oloko macalo lanebi kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“Kabedowu birii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">kalarewu kigero ipata got;<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />ento wun jo Kenit kibiyakowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:22">wubitum woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:22">Jo Aciria gin biterowu i opii pi kare marom mene?”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Dok oloko macalo lanebi kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Anga ma bikwo ka Lubanga otimo man?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Lukwang mel gibibino ma gin a ki tung Caiprac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">gibiyelo jo Aciria ki jo Eber matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">gin bene kibinekogi kityekogi woko matwal.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Lacen Balaam oa malo odok cen kama en bedo iye; ki Balak bene ocito woko.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guworo jok Baal me Peor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Ikare ma jo Icrael gubedo i Citim, gucako timo abor ikom anyira Moab. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Anyira Moab gubedo kalwongo jo Icrael kama kitumu iye gitum bot jogigi, ci jo Icrael gucamo ringo ma kityero bot jogi dok gin guryebe inyim jogi kaworogi. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Kitmeno jo Icrael guribe ken gi ka woro jok Baal me Peor, ci kiniga omako Rwot ikomgi. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Ci Rwot dong owaco bot Moses ni, “Kwany ludito ducu ma ikin lwak, wek idegi iwi yat malo i dyeceng inyim Rwot, wek kiniga pa Rwot mageri oa woko ki ikom jo Icrael.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Ma omiyo Moses owaco ki lungolkop pa jo Icrael ni, “Ngat acel acel ma ikinwu onek jo me kakane ma gin oribe keken gi ka woro jok Baal me Peor.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Dano mo acel ki ikin jo Icrael obino ki nya jo Midian otero iganggi, kun Moses ki lwak jo Icrael ducu gineno, ma onongo lwak tye kakoko inyim dogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Ka Finekaci wod pa Eleajar ma wod pa ajwaka Aron oneno, en oa malo, oweko lwak, omako tong, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />ocito olubu kor Laicrael wa i kicika ma ityelo, ci ocobo gin aryo ducu, Laicrael ki dako meno, ocobo igi pil. Kitmeno omiyo two gemo oa woko ki ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Ento onongo jo ma dong two gemo onekogi onongo giromo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finekaci wod pa Eleajar ma wod pa ajwakana Aron otyeko dong dwoko akecana cen ki ikom jo Icrael, pien nyeko ma omake oweko en otiyo maka an ikin gi, omiyo pe atyeko jo Icrael woko. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Pimeno in iwac bote ni, atyeko miyo bote gicikena me kuc. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />En kacel ki likwaye ma bilube gibibedo i tic me bedo ajwakana matwal pi gicike man ma aketo kwedgi, pien nene nyeko omake pi Lubangane, ci otimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom jo Icrael.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Nying Laicrael ma kineko kacel ki nya jo Midian obedo Jimri wod pa Calu, ma ladit wi kaka i ot pa kwarogi ikin jo pa Cimeon. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Nying dako ma nya jo Midian ma kineko ni Kojibi nya pa Jur mayam ladit wi kaka i ot pa kwarogi ikin jo Midian.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Cit dong magwa ikom jo Midian, ilweny ikomgi; <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />pien gin obwolowu kun gin omiyo wupoto ibal ilok me woro jok me Peor, ki ilok pa lamingi Kojibi nya pa rwot ma kineko ikare ma two gemo opoto.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kwano wel dano tyen me aryo i Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 1:1-46">Wel 1:1-46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I nge two gemo Rwot owaco bot Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar wod pa Aron ni, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Kwan wel jo Icrael ducu, cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo, kun ilubu dog odi pa kwarigi, jo Icrael ducu maromo cito kalweny.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3-4" />Ci Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar guloko ki ludito i lobo aroo me Moab inget Jordan macok ki Jeriko ni, “Wukwan wel dano cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo,” macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:3-4">Jo Icrael mayam gua ki i lobo Ejipt obedo jo magi:<verse eid="NUM 26:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Jo me kaka pa Reuben ma obedo latin kayo pa Yakobo gin ene: likwayo pa Kanok, Pallu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Kejeron ki Karmi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Reuben; welgi ducu oromo alip pyere angwen wiye adek, ki miya abiro ki pyere adek. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Likwayo pa Pallu gin aye Eliab, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />ki awobene Nemuel, Datan ki Abiram. Man aye Datan ki Abiram ma lwak oyerogi mayam opyem ki Moses ki Aron kun gibedo ikin lwak pa Kora ikare ma gin ojemo ikom Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Lobo ongamo doge omwonyogi woko ci guto kacel ki Kora ikare ma mac owango dano miya aryo ki pyere abic, otyekogi woko, ci nyinggi odoko labol me juku dano. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Ento awobe pa Kora pe guto.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Jo me kaka pa Cimeon gin ene: likwayo pa Nemuel, Jamin, Jakin, <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Jera ki Caul. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Cimeon; welgi ducu oromo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo, ki miya aryo.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Jo me kaka pa Gad gin ene: likwayo pa Jepon, Kagi, Cuni, <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Ojini, Eri, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />Arod ki Areli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Gad; welgi ducu oromo alip pyere angwen, ki miya abic.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Kaka pa Juda: Er ki Onan ma awobe pa Juda mayam gin oto con i lobo Kanaan. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Dong jo me kaka pa Juda gin ene: likwayo pa Cela, Perej ki Jera, <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />ki pa Kejeron ki Kamul ma awobe pa Perej. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Juda: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere abiro wiye abicel ki miya abic.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Jo me kaka pa Icakar gin ene: likwayo pa Tola, Puwa, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />Jacub ki Cimron. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Icakar: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere abicel wiye angwen, ki miya adek.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Jo me kaka pa Jabulon gin ene: likwayo pa Cered, Elon ki Jaleel. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Jabulon: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere abicel, ki miya abic.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Jo me kaka pa Yucepu gin aye likwayo pa Manace ki Epraim.<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Kaka pa Manace: Makir wod pa Manace onywalo Gilead. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Jo pa Gilead gin ene: likwayo pa Iejer, Kelek <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />Aciriel, Cekem, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />Cemida ki Keper. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Jelopekad wod pa Keper onywalo anyira keken, awobene peke, nying anyirane Makala, Noa, Kogla, Milka ki Tirja. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Manace: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere abic wiye aryo, ki miya abiro.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Jo me kaka pa Epraim gin ene: likwayo pa Cutela, Beker, Takan, <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />ki pa Eran ma wod pa Cutela. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Epraim: welgi oromo alip pyere adek wiye aryo, ki miya abic. Meno ducu gubedo likwayo pa Yucepu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Jo me kaka pa Benjamin gin ene: likwayo pa Bela, Acibel, Akiram, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />Cepupam, Kupam, <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />ki pa Arud ki Naaman ma awobe pa Bela. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Benjamin: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abic, ki miya abicel.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Jo me kaka pa Dan gin ene: likwayo pa Cukam, <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />dogola ducu pa likwayo pa Cukam wel danogi oromo alip pyere abicel wiye angwen, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Jo me kaka pa Acer gin ene: likwayo pa Imna, Icivi ki Beria, <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />ki pa Keber ki Malkiel ma awobe pa Beria. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Nya pa Acer nyinge obedo Cera. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Acer: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere abic wiye adek, ki miya angwen.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Jo me kaka pa Naputali gin ene: likwayo pa Jajeel, Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Jejer ki Cilem. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Man aye dogola pa jo pa Naputali: welgi ducu oromo alip pyere angwen wiye abic, ki miya angwen. <verse eid="NUM 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Wel jo Icrael ducu oromo alip miya abicel ki acel, ki miya abiro ki pyere adek.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 34:13">Wel 34:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1-2">Yoc 14:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Ibipoko lobo ikin kaka magi obed me aleyagi kun ilubu wel nyinggi ma kicoyo. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Ibimiyo dul lobo malac bot kaka maditone ki dul lobo manok bot kaka ma tino; dul lobo me aleyagi kibipoko ma oporo wel dano ma i kaka moni. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Lobo kibipoko ki bolo kwir kun lubu kaka pa kwarigi. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Gin bilimo lobo me aleyagi muporo dit pa kaka acel acel kun lubu kit ma kwir opoto kwede.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaka pa Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Jo me kaka pa Levi gin aye dogola pa Gercon, Kokat ki Merari, <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />kacel ki likwayo pa Libni, Kebron, Makali, Muci ki Kora. Kokat onywalo Amram, <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />ma dakone obedo Yokobedi nya pa Levi ma onywalo i Ejipt. Yokobedi onywalo Aron ki Moses ki lamingi Miriam. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:2">Wel 3:2</ref></char></note>Aron onywalo Nadab, Abiu, Eleajar ki Itamar. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:46">Wel 3:46</ref></char></note>Ento Nadab ki Abiu gin oto woko ikare ma gin otyero mac mapat inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Kikwano wel jo pa Levi ducu ma co, cake ikom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo. Welgi oromo alip pyere aryo wiye adek: ento welgi yam pe kikwano ikin jo Icrael, pien pe kipoko botgi dul lobo mo me aleyagi ikin jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleb ki Yocwa aye gudong makwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Meno aye gin jo ma Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar okwanogi i lobo aroo me Moab inget Jordan, macok ki Jeriko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Ento pe tye ngat mo acel ikin gi ki ikin jo mayam Moses ki ajwaka Aron okwanogi ikare ma kikwano wel jo Icrael i tim me Cinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Wel 14:26-35</ref></char></note>Onongo yam Rwot owaco pirgi bot Moses ni, “Gin bito woko i tim,” ci dano mo pe odong ki ikin gi, kono Kaleb wod pa Jepune ki Yocwa wod pa Nun keken aye gudong.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s1">Koko pa anyira pa Jelopekad</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 36:1-12">Wel 36:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Ikare meno anyira pa Jelopekad gubino bot Moses. Jelopekad obedo wod pa Keper, wod pa Gilead, ma wod pa Makir, wod pa Manace; gin aye jo me dogola pa Manace wod pa Yucepu. Nying anyirane aye Makala, Noa, Kogla, Milka ki Tirja. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Gin gubino gucung inyim Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar, ki inyim lutel wic ki lwak jo Icrael ducu idogola Kema me Rwate, ci guwaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Wonwa yam oto woko i tim, en yam peke ikin lwak jo ca ma gujemo ikom Rwot, i lwak pa Kora, ento oto mere pi bale kene gire; en yam pe onywalo awobe. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Pi tyen lok ango mamiyo kikwanyo nying wonwa woko ki ikin dogolane? Pi lutino co ma en pe onywaloni bo? Mi ki wan dul lobo mo ikin omegi wonwa.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Ci Moses otero lok me kokogi inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Ci Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 36:2">Wel 36:2</ref></char></note>“Lok pa anyira pa Jelopekad tye atir. Ibipoko lobo botgi ikin omego pa won gi obed me aleyagi, wek gule dul lobo ma myero obed pa won gi. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Dok iwac bot jo Icrael ni, ‘Ka laco mo oto ma pe onywalo wode mo, ci wubimiyo ginaleyane bot nyare. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Ka nyare mo peke, ci kimiyo bot omegine. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Ka omine mo peke, ci kimiyo bot omin wone. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Ka omin wone mo peke ci kimiyo ginaleyane bot watgi macok ma idogolagi, ci bidoko mere. Man aye bibedo cik bot jo Icrael, ki lok ma dong kingolo, macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses.’”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyero Yocwa me leyo katyen Moses</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Nwo 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 3:2-3">Nwo 3:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">32:48-52</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Cit malo iwi got man me Abarim, wek inen lobo ma abimiyo bot jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Ka dong ineno, ci in bene dong ibito, idok bot lutuwu, macalo yam omeru Aron odok botgini; <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />pien yam wujemo ikom loka i tim Jin ikare ma lwak okeco ikoma ca, kun pe wunyutu ni an aleng inyimgi, iwang pii kunu.” (Man aye pii me Meriba macok ki Kadec i tim Jin.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Moses olego Rwot kun waco ni, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Ai Rwot Lubanga maloyo tipu kom jo ducu, tim ber iket dano mo me loyo lwak, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Luk 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eje 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note>wek owire ikin gi macalo laditgi, dok otel nyimgi kama gin bicito iye ducu, wek lwaki pe obed macalo romi ma lakwatgi peke.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:13">Nia 24:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Kwany Yocwa wod pa Nun, dano matye ki cwiny, en aye iket cingi ikome. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Imii en ocung inyim ajwaka Eleajar ki inyim lwak ducu, ci ibicike pi tice inyimgi ducu. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Dok imiine tweroni mogo, wek lwak jo Icrael ducu gubed ka woro doge. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Nia 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:41">1 Cam 14:41</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">28:6</ref></char></note>En bicung inyim ajwaka Eleajar ma en aye bipenyo lok ma Rwot ongolo kun tiyo ki Urim inyim Rwot; kitmeno en kacel ki lwak jo Icrael ducu gibitiyo gin ducu kun gilubu lok pa Eleajar.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Moses otiyo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede; okwanyo Yocwa, omiyo ocung inyim ajwaka Eleajar inyim lwak ducu, <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:23">Nwo 31:23</ref></char></note>ci oketo cinge iwiye, ocike pi tice, macalo Rwot ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s1">Tyer me nino ducu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Nia 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Cik jo Icrael kun iwaco botgi ni, ‘Myero wunen ni wukelo bota tyera ikare ma kiciko, en aye cama me gityer ma kiwango ki mac me bedo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwinya.’<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Dok iwac botgi ni, man aye gityer ma kiwango ki mac ma wubityero bot Rwot: lutino nyogi romi aryo ma ditogi mwaka acel acel ma komgi pe kimwonyo, inino acel acel, obed gitum awanga me nino ducu. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Wubityero latin romo acel odiko, ki latin romo mukene wubityero otyeno, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />kacel ki moko kwon mapwot maromo agwata acel ma kirubu ki moo nyig jeituni ma kiodo aoda maromo lita acel pi gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Meno aye gitum me nino ducu mayam kiciko pire iwi got Cinai obed gin ma ngwece kur, tyer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Gityer amata ma otiko en bibedo kongo bwino maromo lita acel pi latin romo acel acel; wubiliyo kongo bwino makec me gityer amata i Kabedo Maleng inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Latin romo mukene wubityero otyeno kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata kit macalo wutimo ki gityer me odiko; bibedo gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.”<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer me nino me Cabit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Ikom nino me Cabit wubityero nyogi romi aryo ma ditogi mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo, ki moko kwon mapwot maromo agwata aryo, ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon, ki gityer amata ma otiko en. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Man aye gitum awanga me nino me Cabit acel acel ma wubimedo ikom gitum awanga me nino ducu ki gityer amata ma otiko en.”<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer me por dwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“I acaki dwe ducu en aye wubityero iye gitum awanga bot Rwot: lutino twoni aryo, nyok romo acel ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo; <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />kacel ki moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo maromo agwata adek pi twon acel acel, agwata aryo pi nyok romo acel <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />ki agwata acel pi latin romo acel acel; bibedo gitum awanga ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny, gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Gityer amata ma otikogi bibedo kongo bwino maromo lita aryo pi twon, lita acel ki nucu pi nyok romo, ki lita acel pi latin romo. Man aye gitum awanga me dwe acel acel pi dwe ducu ma i mwaka. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Dok bene wubityero nyok dyel acel bot Rwot pi gitum me bal; wubimedo ikom gitum awanga me nino ducu ki gityer amata.”<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer me nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi pe iye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Lev 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Nia 12:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-2">Nwo 16:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>“Inino dwe apar wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo en aye nino madit me Karama me Kato pa Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Nia 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:15">23:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:18">34:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3-8">Nwo 16:3-8</ref></char></note>Dok ikom nino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe acelu en aye nino madit; wubicamo mugati ma tobi pe iye pi nino abiro. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Ikom nino mukwongone wubibedo iye ki gure maleng; pe wutii iye tic mo. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Ento wubityero iye gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gitum awanga bot Rwot: lutino twoni aryo, nyok romo acel, ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi mwaka acel acel; wunen ni komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Wubityero bene gityer me moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo. Wumii maromo agwata adek pi twon acel acel, agwata aryo pi nyok romo, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />ki agwata acel pi latin romo acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel bot Rwot pi gitum me kwanyo bal ki ikomwu. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Wubityero gitum magi kun wumedo ki gitum awanga me odiko, ma en gitum awanga me nino ducu. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Wubityero cam me gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot, kitmeno pi nino abiro ki ipiny maruu ducu; wubityero kun wumedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu ki gityer amata ma otiko en. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Inino me abirone wubibedo ki gure maleng: pe wutii iye tic mo.”<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer me nino madit me pwoyo kac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Lev 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:16">Nia 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-12">Nwo 16:9-12</ref></char>
    </note>“Ikom nino me tyero cam me wi mwaka, ma wukelo iye gityer me moko kwon manyen bot Rwot i ninowu madit me kwero Karama me Kac, wubibedo iye ki gure maleng. Pe wutii iye tic mo. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Ento wutyer iye gitum awanga, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot: lutino twoni aryo, nyok romo acel, ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi mwaka acel acel; <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />kacel ki gityer me moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo. Wumii maromo agwata adek pi twon acel acel, agwata aryo pi nyok romo, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />ki agwata acel pi latin romo acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi kwanyo bal ki ikomwu. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Wubityerogi kacel ki gityer amata ma otikogi kun wumedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu. Wunen ni komgi pe kimwonyo.”<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s1">Gityer pi acaki mwaka manyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Lev 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />“Inino dwe acel me dwe me abiro wubibedo iye ki gure maleng; pe wutii iye tic mo. En aye nino ma wubimiyo gwara kok iye. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Dok wubityero iye gitum awanga, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot: wod twon acel, nyok romo acel ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo; <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />kacel ki gityer me moko mapwot ma kirubu ki moo ma otikogi, agwata adek pi wod twon, agwata aryo pi nyok romo <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />ki agwata acel pi latin romo acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal me kwanyo bal ki ikomwu. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Meno ducu wubityero kun wumedo ki gitum awanga me poo dwe ki gityer me moko kwon ma otiko en, ki gitum awanga me nino ducu ki gityer me moko kwon, ki gityer amatagi kit ma cikgi tye. Gibibedo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny, gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot.”<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer pi Nino madit me Kwanyo Bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Lev 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lev 16:29-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Inino dwe apar me dwe me abiro wubibedo ki gure maleng, kun wurii kec; pe wutii iye tic mo. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Ento wutyer gitum awanga bot Rwot, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwinye: wod twon acel, nyok romo acel ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi mwaka acel acel; wunen ni komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Wumii bene gityer me moko kwon mapwot ma kirubu ki moo, agwata adek pi wod twon, agwata aryo pi nyok romo, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />ki agwata acel pi latin romo acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal ma ki medo ki gitum me bal me lakwany bal, ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer mere me moko kwon, ki gityer amata ma otikogi ducu.”<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gityer pi nino madito me Bolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Lev 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“Inino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro wubibedo ki gure maleng; pe wutii iye tic mo. Wubikwero nino madito me woro Rwot pi nino abiro. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Wubityero gitum awanga inino man ma okwongoni, gityer ma kiwango ki mac wek obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. Lutino twoni apar wiye adek, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi mwaka acel acel; gin obed ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Wubimiyo gityer me moko kwon ma otikogi, moko mapwot ma kirubu ki moo maromo agwata adek pi twoni apar wiye adek ki acel acel, agwata aryo pi nyogi romi aryo pi acel acel, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />ki agwata acel pi lutino romi apar wiye angwen pi acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />Inino me aryone wubimiyo lutino twoni apar wiye aryo, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo, <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata pi twoni ki nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon mere ki gityer amata ma otikogi ducu.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />Inino me adeke wubimiyo lutino twoni apar wiye acel, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo, <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata pi twoni ki nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />Inino me angwene wubimiyo lutino twoni apar, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Wubityero kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata pi twoni ki nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Wubityerogi bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />Inino me abice wubimiyo lutino twoni abongwen, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Wubityerogi kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata pi twoni ki nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />Inino me abicele wubimiyo lutino twoni aboro, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Wubityerogi kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ki twoni, nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Inino me abirone wubimiyo lutino twoni abiro, nyogi romi aryo ki lutino nyogi romi apar wiye angwen ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Wubityerogi kacel ki gityer me moko kwon, gityer amata pi twoni ki nyogi romi ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />Inino me aborone wubibedo iye ki gure madit me woro Lubanga; pe wutii iye tic mo, <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />ento wutyer iye gitum awanga, gityer ma kiwango ki mac wek obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot: twon acel, nyok romo acel ki lutino nyogi romi abiro ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel, ma komgi pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Wubityerogi kacel ki gityer me moko kwon, gityer amata pi twon ki nyok romo ki lutino romi malubu welgi, macalo cik tye. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Wubityero bene nyok dyel acel pi gitum me bal kun kimedo ki gitum awanga me nino ducu, ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otiko en.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />Meno aye gin ma wubityero bot Rwot i ninowu madito ma kiciko, kun wumedo iye gityerwu me cobo kwongwu ki gityer mukene ma iwu opwoyo, pi gitumwu me awanga, gityer me moko kwon ki me amata, dok pi gityerwu me berbedo.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Moses otito ki jo Icrael lok ducu ma Rwot ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako kwong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Moses owaco bot ludito wi kaka pa jo Icrael ni, man gin ma Rwot ociko. <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:21-23">Nwo 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat 5:33</ref></char></note>“Ka laco mo okwongo kwong mo bot Rwot, nyo ocike pi lok mo kun otwene kene ki cike me timo gin moni, myero pe otur cikene, ento myero ocob kakare kit ma ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />Nyo ka nyako mo okwongo kwong mo bot Rwot, otwene kwede ki cike me timo gin moni ma kun tye i paco pa wone ikare ma pud tidi, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />ka wone owinyo pi kwonge ki cike ma otwene kwede kekene, ci pe omedo ki waco iye lok mo bote, ci kwong ducu ma en okwongo ki cike ducu ma otwene kwede kekene bimoko ikome matwal. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Ento ka wone ojuke woko inino ma owinyo iye loke ni, ci kwong pa nyako meno ki lok ma otwene kwede kekene pe bimoko ikome; Rwot bene bitime kica, pien wone onongo pe ocwako kwongeni.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />Kace kinyomo nyako mo ma nongo okwongo kwong nyo otwene kekene ki cike kun oloko labongo tamo tere, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />ce cware owinyo pire, ci pe omedo ki waco iye lok mo bote inino ma owinyo iyeni, ci kwonge ki cike ma otwene kwede kekene bimoko ikome matwal. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Ento kace cware ojuke woko inino ma owinyo iye loke ni, ci cware bikwanyo kwong meno woko ki ikome, nyo lok mo ma onongo otwene kwede kekene kun oloko labongo tamo tere; Rwot bene bitime kica.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Kace dato nyo dako ma cware oryemo okwongo kwong, ci lok ducu ma en otwene kwede kekene bimoko ikome.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />Ka dako mo okwongo kwong nyo otwene kekene ki cike ma dong kinyomo woko, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />ce cware owinyo pire ci pe omedo ki waco iye lok mo bote, dok pe ojuke, ci kwong ducu ma en okwongo, ki cike ducu ma otwene kwede, bimoko ikome. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Ento kace cware ogenge woko inino ma owinyo pireni, ci lok ducu ma dako meno oloko ma mako kwong ma okwongo nyo cike ma otwene kwede pe bimoko, pien cware dong ogenge woko. Rwot bene bitime kica iye. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Kwong ducu ma dako okwongo nyo ma otwene kwede me keto aroma ikome kekene, cware twero moko, dok cware twero gengo woko. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Ento ka cware pe owaco lok mo bote, ce obedo kaling alinga nino ducu, miyo en moko kwede kwong pa dakone ducu ki cike ducu ma otwene kwede kekene, pien pe owaco lok mo bote inino ma owinyo iye pireni. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Ento ka cware orii ma pe ogenge woko oyotoyot, ci bal pa dakone bidok iwiye ka pe ocobo.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Meno aye cik ma Rwot ociko ki Moses ma mako laco ki dakone ka okwongo kwong, ki won nyako ki nyare ka okwongo kwong ikare ma en pud tidi, ma nongo pud tye i gang pa wone.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guculu kwor ikom jo Midian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Dong icul kwor pa jo Icrael ikom jo Midian; ka lacen dong ibito, idok bot lutuwu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Ci Moses owaco ki lwak ni, “Wumii lumony ma gitye ikinwu guruke ki jami lwenygi, wek gucit kalweny ikom jo Midian, wek gucul kwor pa Rwot ikomgi. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Wucwal dano alip acel acel ma gia ki i kaka acel acel ma i Icrael gucit ilweny.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Kitmeno gin onongo dano alip apar wiye aryo ma guyube pi lweny ma gua ki i kaka mapatpat i Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Moses ocwalogi woko kalweny, kacel ki Finekaci wod pa ajwaka Eleajar ma omako jami maleng pa Lubanga ki tum me goyo oduru. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Gulwenyo ikom jo Midian macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses, ci guneko co ducu. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Luker abic pa jo Midian gubedo tye ikin dano ma kinekogi. Nyinggi ene; Evi, Rekem, Jur, Kur ki Reba. Gin bene oneko Balaam wod pa Beor ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Jo Icrael guyako mon ki lutino pa jo Midian, guterogi woko; ki dok gumayo leegi makwo madito ki matino ducu, ki jamigi ducu. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Taun madito pa jo Midian ki kabedo mapatpat ma gibedo iye, kiwango woko. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Jo Icrael gucito ki jami ducu ma kiyako nyo ma kimayo, dano wa ki leegu. <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />Gin okelogi bot Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar ki bot lwak jo Icrael, i gonygi ma i lobo aroo me Moab inget Jordan, macok ki Jeriko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lumony gudwogo ki i lweny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar ki lutel wi lwak ducu gucito woko karwate kwedgi inge gony. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Ci kiniga omako Moses ludito me mony ikom lulo dano alip ki lulo dano miya ma gudwogo ki katero dano i mony. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Moses owaco botgi ni, “Man wuweko mon ducu gudong makwo pingo? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Wel 25:1-9</ref></char></note>Nen, mon magi aye yam gulubu tam pa Balaam ci omiyo jo Icrael gungayo wang Rwot ilok me woro Baal, ma omiyo Rwot ocwalo two gemo opoto ikom lwak pa Rwot ki i Peor. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Kombedi dong wunek lutino co woko ducu ma ikin lutinogi, dok wunek mon ducu ma dong gutyeko ngene ki co.<verse eid="NUM 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Ento lutino anyira ducu ma peya gubutu ki co wugwokgi makwo gin obed mewu. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Kong wubut woko inge gony pi nino abiro. Jo ducu ma ikinwu ma guneko dano, ki jo ducu ma gugudu kom dano ma oto myero wulonye kekenwu, kacel ki dano ma wuyakogi, inino me adeke ki inino me abirone. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Wulony bongi aruka ducu, gin ducu ma kiyubu ki laa, nyo ma kicweyo ki yer dyegi, ki jami ducu ma kiyubu ki bao nyo ki yat.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Ci ajwaka Eleajar owaco bot lulweny ma onongo gucito i mony ni, “Man aye cik ma kiketo, mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />jami ma obedo jabu, ryal, mola, nyonyo, koc, nyo racac, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ki jami ducu ma mac pe balo, omyero owok okato ki i mac ci bilony woko. Ento kadi bed kitmeno, pud dok kibilonyogi ki pii me lwoko kwer; ci jami ducu ma mac balo woko wubimiyo wok kato ki ipii. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Myero wulwok bongiwu inino me abirone, ci dong wubibedo ma wulony; ka lacen wubibino i gony.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poko jami ma kiyako ki imony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Dong ikwan wel jami ma kiyako ki i mony, dano ki lee bene; kwan wun ki ajwaka Eleajar ki ludito kaka ma iot pa kwarigi ma ikin lwak. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Ci ipok jami ma kiyako imony i dul aryo, tung cel pi lulweny ma gin gucito i mony, tung cel pi lwak ducu. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Dok i jog ajog pa Rwot ki bot lulweny ma gucito imony kun i kwanyo acel ikom miya abic ki ikom dano ma kimako, ki twoni, ki kana, ki romi ki dyegi. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Kwany ki ikom nucu ma megi, ci imii bot ajwaka Eleajar obed gityer bot Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Ikom nucu ma tung bot jo Icrael ibikwanyo iye acel ikom pyere abic ki kom dano, ki twoni, kana, romi nyo dyegi, ki ikom lim makwo ducu, ci imii bot Lulevi ma gin gwoko kema pa Rwot.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Ci Moses ki Eleajar otiyo kit ma Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Jami ma lulweny oyako, ma odong, onongo obedo romi alip miya abicel ki pyere abiro wiye abic, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />dyangi alip pyere abiro wiye aryo, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />kana alip pyere abicel wiye acel, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />ki dano alip pyere adek wiye aryo ma gin ducu aye anyira ma peya gubutu ki co. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Nucune ma kipoko bot jo ma gucito i mony obedo romi alip miya adek ki pyere adek wiye abiro, ki miya abic; <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />romi ma kijogo pi Rwot oromo miya abicel ki pyere abiro wiye abic. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Dyangi oromo alip pyere adek wiye abicel; dyangi ma kijogo pi Rwot oromo pyere abiro wiye aryo. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Kana obedo alip pyere adek, ki miya abic; ki kana ma kijogo pi Rwot oromo pyere abicel wiye acel. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Dano oromo alip apar wiye abicel; ci dano ma kijogo pi Rwot oromo pyere adek wiye aryo. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Moses omiyo dul ma kijogo me gityer pa Rwot bot ajwaka Eleajar, macalo Rwot ocike.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Nucu ma kipoko ki jo Icrael, ma Moses opoko obedo pat ki pa jo mayam gucito i mony, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />obedo romi alip miya adek ki pyere adek wiye abiro, ki miya abic, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />dyangi alip pyere adek wiye abicel, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />kana alip pyere adek, ki miya abic, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />ki dano alip apar wiye abicel. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Ikom nucu man ma obedo pi lwak Moses okwanyo iye acel ki ikom pyere abic, ikom dano ki ikom lee, ci omiyogi bot Lulevi ma gin gwoko kema pa Rwot, macalo Rwot ocike kwede.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Ka dong ludito ma gin loyo lumony ducu, lulo dano alip ki lulo dano miya, gubino bot Moses. <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />Gin owaco ni, “Wan lutici watyeko kwano wel lumony ma gitye ite locwa, ci wanongo ni pe tye dano acel mo ma orwenyo ki ikin gi. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Wan dong wakelo gityerwa bot Rwot, gin ma dano acel acel onongo i lweny, jami me jabu, mola me bad, atego ngut cing, agit cing ki tiko ngut, pi kwanyo bal ki ikomwa inyim Rwot.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar ogamo jabu meno ki botgi; gin ducu obedo jami me deyo kom ma kiyubu ki diro. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Jabu ducu ma lulo dano alip ki lulo dano miya otyero bot Rwot pekke romo kilo miya aryo. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Lulweny ducu ma pe ludito mony gugwoko jami ducu, ma ngat acel acel oyako pire kene. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Moses ki ajwaka pa Lubanga gugamo jabu ki bot ludito wi mony, gutero i Kema me Rwate obed gin me poyo wi Rwot ikom jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s1">Kaka ma onongo kabedo inge kulu Jordan tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Nwo 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Jo me kaka pa Reuben ki pa Gad gubedo ki lwak lim makwo mapol tutwal. Ka guneno lobo Jajer ki lobo Gilead obedo lobo maber tutwal me kwat, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />ci gucito bot Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar ki bot lutel wi lwak, ci guwaco ni, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Taun magi; Atarot, Dibon, Jajer, Nimra, Kecbon, Eleale, Cebam, Nebo ki Beon <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />ma i lobo mayam Rwot oloyo inyim lwak jo Icrael, lobogi ber tutwal me kwat. Dong wan luticwuni watye ki lim madwong. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Ka in bene ipwoyo tamwani, ci iye lobo man kimii botwa obed mewa, pe dong iterwa wangol loka Jordan.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Ento Moses owaco bot jo pa Gad ki pa Reuben ni, “Omegiwu bicito kalweny ma nongo wun wudong kany bo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Pingo wumito balo cwiny jo Icrael, ni pe gucit loka ca i lobo mayam Rwot omiyo botgi? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:17-33">Wel 13:17-33</ref></char></note>Kwariwu bene yam kong gutimo kitmeno ikare ma acwalogi ki i Kadec-barnea pi neno lobo. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Pien ka gucito malo wa i nota me Ecikol, ka guneno lobo, ci gubalo cwiny jo Icrael woko, ni pe gucit i lobo ma Rwot dong otyeko miyo botgi. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Wel 14:26-35</ref></char></note>Ci kiniga omako Rwot ikomgi inino maca, oweko okwongo kwong kun waco ni, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Ada, pe tye ngat mo ki ikin jo mayam gua ki i Ejipt, cake ki ikom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo ma bineno lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo bot Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo, pien gin pe obedo kalubu gin ma amito ducu kakare. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Pe tye ngat mo ma bineno, kono Kaleb wod pa Jepune ma jo Keniji, ki Yocwa wod pa Nun, pien gin aye gubedo kalubu gin ma amito ducu kakare.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Ci kiniga omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael ikare ca, omiyo gubedo kawire i tim atata pi mwaka pyere angwen kulu, nio ka yalwak mayam otimo rac inyim Rwot otum woko. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Ci nen, wun lutino pa lubalo, kombedi dong wua malo maka wonwu pi medo kiniga pa Rwot mager ikom jo Icrael! <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Pien ka wuweko lubu gin ma Rwot mito kombedi, ci en dok bitenyo lwak man woko i tim ata; kitmeno miyo lwak man ducu gito gitum woko.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Ka gin dok gubino bote kun giwaco ni, “Wan kong wabigero dwol ki gweng pi romiwa, ki gangi pi mon ki lutinowa. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Ento wan wabiruku jami lwenywa, kun wayube pi telo wi jo Icrael anyim, nio ka wabiterogi i kabedogi, kun nongo monwa ki lutinowa gibibedo i gangi gogo ma wacelo matek wek ogwokgi ki ikom dano ma gibedo i loboni. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Pe wabidwogo i pacowa nio wang ma jo Icrael ducu gutyeko nongo ginaleyagi ki acel acel. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Wan pe wabinywako leyo lobo kacel kwedgi inge kulu Jordan ki tung kunu ducu, pien ginaleya ma mewa dong watyeko nongone i loka Jordan kany matye tung kunyango.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Ma omiyo Moses dok owaco botgi ni, “Kace wubitimo kitmeno, ma wubiruku jami lwenywu wucito anyim kalweny inyim Rwot, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />kun dano acel acel ikinwu maromo lweny kato loka Jordan inyim Rwot, nio ka Rwot otyeko ryemo lumeroke woko ki inyime, ci ber. <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />Ka Rwot dong otyeko loyo lobo meno, ci lacen wubidwogo giwu kun banya mo peke ikomwu bot Rwot nyo bot jo Icrael, ci lobo man wubicamo bedo mewu inyim Rwot. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Ento ka pe wutimo kitmeno, ci nen, nongo wutimo bal ikom Rwot. Myero wunge ni, balwu bimiyo wutingo alii ma bidwarowu. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Dong wuger gangi pi mon ki lutinowu, ki dwol pi romiwu; ento wucob gin ducu ma wun wuwaco ni wubitimo.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Jo pa Gad ki pa Reuben gudok iye bot Moses ni, “Wan lutici; wabitiyo kit macalo in laditwa iciko ducu. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Lutinowa ki monwa ki limwa makwo ducu gin bidong kany i taun ma i Gilead. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Ento wan ducu ma waruku jami lweny wabikato wangolo loka ca kalweny inyim Rwot kit macalo in laditwa icikoni.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Yoc 1:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kitmeno Moses omiyo cik ma makogi bot ajwaka Eleajar ki bot Yocwa wod pa Nun, ki bot ludito wi odi pa kwarigi ma i kaka ducu pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />En owaco botgi ni, “Ka jo Gad ki jo Reuben ma dong guruke pi lweny inyim Rwot gin bikato ngolo kwedwu loka Jordan, dok ka wun wuloyo lobo meno woko, ci wubimiyo botgi lobo Gilead obed meggi. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Ento ka gin pe bikato loka ca kacel kwedwu kun guruke me lweny, ci gin binywako camo lobo Kanaan kacel kwedwu.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Jo pa Gad ki pa Reuben gin odok iye ni, “Wabitimo kit ma Rwot dong oloko botwa, ladit. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Wabikato loka ca inyim Rwot, wabicito i lobo Kanaan kun waruke me lweny, wek lobo ma loka Jordan kany odong i cingwa ci bedo me aleyawa.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Ci Moses omiyo bot jo pa Gad ki jo pa Reuben ki nucu kaka pa Manace wod pa Yucepu lobo mayam obedo pa Cikon rwot pa jo Amor ki Og rwot me Bacan, lobo ducu ma gin yam guloyo, kacel ki taun ducu ma i lobo meno ki lobo ma ingetgi ducu. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Ci jo pa Gad gugero Dibon, Atarot, Aroer, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />Atarot-copan, Jajer, Jogbeka, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Bet-nimra ki Bet-aran, gin ducu taun ma kicelo ki cel gogo, ki dwol pi romigi. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Jo pa Reuben gugero Kecbon, Eleala, Kiriataim, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />Nebo ki Baal-meon (nying magi mukene yam kilokogi woko) ki Cibma; ci gucako nying mukene pi taun ma gin ogeroni.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Jo pa Makir wod pa Manace gucito i lobo Gilead, gumako ci gumayo woko ki bot jo Amor ma onongo gitye kunu. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ci Moses omiyo Gilead bot jo pa Makir wod pa Manace, ci gucako bedo iye. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Jair me kaka pa Manace ocito omako gangi matino mapol, ci ocako nyinggi ni, Kavot-jair.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:41 </char><char style="fk">Kavot-jair </char> tyen loke ni gangi mapol. </note> <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Dok Noba ocito omako Kenat ki gangi matino ma ingete, ci ocako nyinge Noba, macalo nyinge kikome.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s1">Wot pa jo Icrael nia ki Ejipt nio kwede i Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Jo Icrael yam guwoto kun gikobo ki wotgi kit man, ikare ma gua woko ki i lobo Ejipt ki bucagi kun Moses ki Aron aye telo wigi. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Moses yam ocoyo nying kabedo ducu ma gubedo iye ki acel acel nia i acaki, kit macalo Rwot ociko. Man aye nying kabedo kit ma gubedo kakobo ki wotgi.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Jo Icrael gua woko ki i Ramecec inino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe mukwongo, inino malubu nino madit me Karama me Kato. Gin gua gucito woko ki wayu kun jo Ejipt ducu nenogi. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Jo Ejipt kono onongo gitye kayiko lutino kayogi ma onongo Rwot onekogi woko. Rwot otimo man me nyutu ni tekone dit loyo pa lubanga mukenegu ducu pa jo Ejipt.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gua ki i Ramecec, ci gugony i Cukot. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Gua ki i Cukot, ci gugony i Etam matye i dog tim aroo. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Gua ki i Etam, ci guloke gudok cen i Piakirot ma tung kunyango me Baal-jepon; ci gugony inyim Migdol. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Gua ki i Pi-akirot ci guwok gukato ki i dye Nam Makwar, ci guo i tim. Gin owoto wot me nino adek i dye tim me Etam, ci gugony i Mara. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Gua ki i Mara, gubino i Elim. I Elim yam tye iye wang it apar wiye aryo, ki otit pyere abiro; ci gugony kunu.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Gua ki i Elim, ci gugony inget Nam Makwar. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Gua ki inget Nam Makwar, gugony i tim Cin. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Gua ki i tim Cin, ci gugony i Dopka. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Gua ki i Dopka, ci gugony i Aluc. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Gua ki i Aluc, ci gugony i Repidim kama pii amata pa dano obedo peke iye.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Gua ki i Repidim ci gucito wa ite got Kor. Ka pud gitye i yo me cito Kor gugony i kabedo magi: tim Cinai, <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Kibrot-atava, <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Kajerot, <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Ritma, <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Rimmon-perej, <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Libna, <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Rica, <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Keelata, <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />got Ceper, <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Karada, <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Makelot, <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Takat, <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Tera, <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Mitka, <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Kacimona, <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Mocerot, <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Bene-jaakan, <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kor-agidgad, <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Jotibata, <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Abrona, <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Ejion-geber, <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />ki tim me Jin, en aye Kadec. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Lacen gugony ite got Kor, i dog wang lobo me Edom.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 20:22-28">Wel 20:22-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:6">Nwo 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:50">32:50</ref></char>
    </note>Ajwaka Aron oito malo iwi got Kor kit ma Rwot ociko, ci oto woko ki kunu, i mwaka me pyere angwene nia ma jo Icrael gua ki i lobo Ejipt, inino mukwongo me dwe me abic. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Aron onongo dong tye ki mwaka me dite miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye adek ikare ma en oto ki iwi got.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:1">Wel 21:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci rwot me Arad, ma en Lakanaan ma bedo i Negeb i lobo owinyo pi bino pa jo Icrael.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Ka gua ki ite got Kor ci gugony i kabedo magi: Jalmona, <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Punon, <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Obot, <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Iye-Abarim ma i lobo Moab, <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Dibon-gad, <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Almon-diblataim. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Gua ki i Almon-diblataim ci gugony i dye godi Abarim, inyim got Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Gua ki kunu, ci gugony i lobo aroo me Moab inget Jordan macok ki Jeriko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Ci guguru kemagi inget Jordan cake ki i Bet-jecimot o kwede wa Abelcitim i bar aroo me Moab.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ociko jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />I lobo aroo me Moab inget Jordan macok ki Jeriko Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Cik jo Icrael ni, ka wungolo kulu Jordan wukato i lobo Kanaan, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />ci wubiryemo jo ma gibedo i lobo meno woko ducu ki inyimwu; wubibalo got megi ducu ma gugoro cal ikomgi, ki cal jogigi me nyonyo ma kiliyo aliya, dok wubimuku wang jogigi ma iwi godi. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Wubicamo lobo meno, wubibedo iye, pien atyeko miyo botwu ni obed mewu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:54-56">Wel 26:54-56</ref></char></note>Wubilimo lobo me aleyawu kun kipoko ki bolo kwir malube ki kit ma dogolawu tye kwede. Wubimiyo dul lobo malac bot kaka maditone ki dul lobo manok bot kaka matino. Kama kwir opoto iye ikom dano moni, en aye bedo mere; wubilimo lobo me aleyawu kun lubu kaka pa kwariwu. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Ento ka pe wuryemo jo ma gibedo i lobo meno woko ki inyimwu, ci jo meno ma wun wuweko odongi bibedo macalo atero mabit me cobo wangwu ki okutu me cobo lakngetwu, ci gin biyelowu i lobo kama wubibedo iyeni. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Ci abitimo ikomwu kit ma onongo atamoni abitimo ikomgi.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s1">Wang apoki me lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Cik jo Icrael kun iwaco botgi ni, ka wudonyo i lobo Kanaan, ma en aye lobo ma kibimiyo ni obed mewu me aleyawu, wang apoki me lobowu bibedo kit man: <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Wang lobowu tung kupiny bicake i tim me Jin ci rabo nget lobo Edom. Bia ki tung agiki nam me Kado ma tung kunyango, <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />ka dong biloke dok tung kupiny ma kemo Akrabim, ka dok kato ki Jin, ki agikine bibedo inget Kadec-barnea tung kumalo. Ka dok cito mede kwede nio wa i Kajar-adar, ka kato cito kwede i Ajimon, <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />ka wang lobo cako loke ki i Ajimon cito wa i nota ora me Ejipt; ci wange bigik i dog nam Mediterranean.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />Wang lobo ma tung kupotoceng bibedo nam Mediterranean; dong dog nam aye bibedo wang lobowu ma tung kupotoceng.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />Man aye bibedo wang lobowu ma tung kumalo, bia ki i nam Mediterranean ci bicito atir o wa ikom got Kor. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Nia ki ikom got Kor bicito atir wa i yoo ma donyo i Kamat, ci cito wa i Jedad; <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />ka dok bimede cito wa i Jipron, ka bigik i Kajar-enon. Man aye bibedo wang lobowu ma tung kumalo.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />Wang lobowu ma tung kunyango bicake ki i Kajar-enon cito atir o wa i Cepam. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Ka wang lobo bilor dok tung kupiny nia ki i Cepam o kwede wa i Ribla ma inget Ain tung kunyango. Ka dok bilor piny cito o kwede i kor got me nam me Kineret tung kunyango. <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Ka dok bilor piny wa i Jordan, ka bigik i nam me Kado. Meno aye bibedo lobowu, ki wang apokine ma orumu ducu.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 14:1-5">Yoc 14:1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Moses dok ociko jo Icrael kun waco ni, “Man aye lobo ma wubileyo kun kipoko ki bolo kwir, mayam Rwot ociko ni kimii bot kakawu abongwen ki nucu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Pien kaka pa Reuben ki kaka pa Gad dong gutyeko gamo ginaleyagi kun lubu dog odi pa kwarigi, kacel ki nucu kaka pa Manace bene. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Gin dong otyeko gamo lobogi loka Jordan mukemo Jeriko, tung kunyango, kama ceng tuc ki iyeni.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Man aye nying dano ma bipoko lobo botwu jo Icrael, wek obed ginaleyawu. Ajwaka Eleajar ki Yocwa wod pa Nun. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Dok wubikwanyo latel wic acel ki i kaka acel acel wek gupok lobo me aleyawu. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Magi aye nying lutel: pi kaka pa Juda, Kaleb wod pa Jepune. <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Pi kaka pa Cimeon, Cemuel wod pa Amikud. <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Pi kaka pa Benjamin, Elidad wod pa Kicion. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Pi kaka pa Dan, Bukki wod pa Jogli. <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Pi likwayo pa Yucepu, me kaka pa Manace, Kaniel wod pa Epod; <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />ki i kaka pa Epraim, Kemuel wod pa Ciptan. <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Pi kaka pa Jabulon, Elijapan wod pa Pamak. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Pi kaka pa Icakar, Paltiel wod pa Ajan. <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Pi kaka pa Acer, Akiud wod pa Celomi. <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Pi kaka pa Naputali, Pedael wod pa Amikud. <verse eid="NUM 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Magi aye dano ma Rwot ociko ni gupok lobo me aleya bot jo Icrael ki i lobo Kanaan.”<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s1">Taun Madito pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 21:1-42">Yoc 21:1-42</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka gitye i lobo aroo me Moab ma inget Jordan mukemo Jeriko Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Cik jo Icrael ni gumi ki Lulevi taun madito me bedogi ki ikom lobo ma gibilimo me aleyagi; dok omyero gumi botgi lobo ma orumu taun madito meno wek obed me oletgi. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Taun madito meno bibedo pa Lulevi me bedogi, ki olet ma ingetgi bibedo pi kwayo dyangigi ki limgi makwo ducu. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Lobo ma wubimiyo bot jo Levi pi oletgi lace biromo mita miya angwen ki pyere abic cake ki icel me taun madit meno kun rumu tungi ki tungi. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Wubipimo dul lobo ma latwoke angwen ma romrom; bor me twoke acel acel bibedo mita miya abongwen, kun taun madit meno bedo idyere. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Wubimiyo bot Lulevi taun madito abicel me laro lunek dano ma pe guneko akaka kama wubiweko lunek ringo iye, dok wubimiyo botgi taun madito mukene pyere angwen wiye aryo me medo ikom meno. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Kitmeno taun madito ducu ma wubimiyo bot Lulevi biromo pyere angwen wiye aboro, kacel ki oletgi. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Taun madito ma wubimiyo botgi wubikwanyo ki ikom lobo ma jo Icrael bigamo; wubikwanyo mabup ki bot kaka madito, dok ki bot kaka matinone wubikwanyo manok, kun kaka acel acel miyo taune mogo bot Lulevi muporo lobo ma ogamo me ginaleyane.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taun madito me laro lunek dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Nwo 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoc 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dong wungolo kulu Jordan, wukato i lobo Kanaan, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />ci wubiyero taun madito mogo wek gubed kabedo me laro lunek dano, wek dano ma pe oneko dano akaka olar iye kome. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Kunu bibedo me laro lanek dano ki bot lacul kwor, wek lanek dano mo pe oto nio ka ocung inyim lwak wek kingole kop. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Wubiyero taun madito abicel, <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />adek loka Jordan tung kunyango ki adek i lobo Kanaan, gubed taun me laro lunek dano. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Taun madito magi abiceli bibedo me laro kom jo Icrael ki pi welowu ki pi lubedo ma gibedo ikinwu, wek ka ngat mo oneko dano kun pe oneko akaka oring olar iye kome.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />Ento ka ngat mo otiyo ki nyonyo, me neko lawote, meno en lanek; kibineke woko. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Kace ocelo dano ki kidi ma omako i cinge, maromo neko dano, ci ocele oto woko, meno en lanek; kibineke woko. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Ka onyo ogoyo ki odo ma omako i cinge, maromo neko dano, ce oto woko, meno en lanek; kibineke woko. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Wat macok pa lato kikome aye bineko lanek dano meno. Ka en ononge, ci romo neke. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />Ka ngat mo obako dano ocobo pil pi mone, nyo otoke ikome ci obaye ocobo woko, kun nongo okiye akiya, ci oto woko, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />nyo ka odonge ki cinge pi mone matye ikin gi ce oto woko, ngat ma ocobe nyo ma odongeni kibineko woko; meno en lanek. Wat macok ki lato kikome aye bineko lanek dano meno ka ononge.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />Ento kace obake ci ocobe oyotoyot ma tyen mone mo pe, nyo otoke ikome ci obaye ocobo ma pe okiye akiya, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />nyo ocele ki kidi maromo neko dano ma nongo pe onene, ci oto woko kadi yam pe en lameroke, dok onongo pe opiro timo en marac, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />ci lwak myero ongol kop ikin lanek ki wat pa lato ma lacul kwor remo kun lubu cik magi. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Lwak myero olar lanek dano ki i cing wat pa lato ma lacul kwor remoni. Lwak bidwoko lanek i taun me laro lunek dano kama yam oringo olaro iye. En bibedo kunu matwal, nio ka ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ma kiwiro ki moo maleng ikare meno otyeko to woko. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Ento ka ikare meno lanek dano ocito okato woko inge taun madit meno, kama yam oringo iyeni, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />ci ka lacul kwor remo pa lato onongo kome owec, kun tye woko inge wang apoki me taun madit meno me laro kome, ce lacul kwor remo pa lato oneko laneki, pe kibikwano alii me remo iwiye. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Pien dano meno myero obed i taun madit meno me laro kom nio wa ikare ma ajwaka madit pa Lubanga bito iye; ento inge to pa ajwaka madit pa Lubanga lanek dano twero dok cen ipacone. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Meno ducu bibedo cik botwu wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ikabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye.”<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cik ma mako lucaden ki lim me kok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nwo 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char>
    </note>“Kace dano mo oneko dano, ci kibineko lanek woko pi lok pa lucaden; ento pe kibineko dano mo pi lok ma lacaden acel keken otito. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Dok pe wubigamo lim me koko kwo pa lanek dano mo ma bale romo to; kibineke aneka. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Dok pe wugam lim me kok mo pi dano ma oringo olaro taun me laro lunek dano, wek kiyene odwog obed i lobone ma nongo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga peya oto. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Pe wubinyobo lobo ma wubibedo iyeni; pien remo nyobo lobo woko, dok pe tye gin mo matwero kwanyo bal ki i lobo pi remo ma oo iyeni, kono remo pa lanek dano meno keken aye kwanyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Pe wubimiyo lobo ma wubedo iye, ma an bene abedo iye i dyewuni, odok keni; pien An a Rwot ma abedo ikin jo Icrael.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako anyira ma guleyo lobo pa won gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Ludito kaka pa kwarigi ma i dogola pa Gilead wod pa Makir ma wod pa Manace ma i dogola pa Yucepu gin obino cok, ci guloko inyim Moses ki ludito kaka mukene. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:7">Wel 27:7</ref></char></note> Guwaco ni, “Laditwa, Rwot yam ociki ni imii lobo me aleya bot jo Icrael kun kibolo kwir; ki yam ociki ni imii ginaleya pa ominwa lyeli Jelopekad bot anyirane. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Ento kace awobe ma i kaka mukene onyomogi ki ikin jo Icrael ata, ci miyo lobogi kibikwanyo woko ki ikom ginaleya pa kwarigi, ci kibimedo ikom lobo pa kaka ma anyirane dong tye iyeni; meno miyo kibijwiko lobowa woko mayam kipoko botwa ki kwir. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Dok ka kare me dwok lobo mayam ki cato, bot rwode oromo, ci lobo pa Jelopekad kibimedo ikom lobo pa kaka ma anyirane kinyomogi iyeni matwal, ci miyo lobowa me aleyawa bijwik woko.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ci Moses ociko jo Icrael kit man, kun cike oa ki bot Rwot ni, “Lok me kaka pa likwayo pa Yucepu tye atir. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Dong man aye cik ma Rwot omiyo ma okemo kom anyira pa lyeli Jelopekad ni, ‘Wek gin onyome ki dano ma gitamo ni ber, teke ka kinyomogi i dogola mo ma i kaka pa kwarogi. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Lobo ma kimiyo bot jo Icrael me aleyagi pe kibilokone nia i kaka man dok i kaka mukene; pien dano acel acel ma ikin jo Icrael bimoko matwal ikom ginaleya ma i kaka pa kwarogi. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Dok ka nyako mo oleyo dul lobo mo ma i kaka mo ma ikin jo Icrael, ci en binyome ki dano mo ma idogola mo ma i kaka pa kwarogi, wek dano acel acel ma ikin jo Icrael obed ki lobone ma oleyo ki bot kwarone. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Kitmeno, pe kibiloko ginaleya mo nia ki i kaka moni dok i kaka mukene, ento kaka acel acel pa jo Icrael bimoko gire i lobo me ginaleyane kikome.’”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Anyira pa Jelopekad otimo kit ma Moses ocikogi kwede. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Makala, Tirja, Kogla, Milka ki Noa, ma gin aye anyira pa Jelopekad, gin onyome ki awobe pa omegi won gi. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Kinyomogi i dogola pa jo pa Manace wod pa Yucepu, omiyo lobo me aleyagi obedo i kaka me dogola pa won gi, pe kikobo woko.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Meno ducu aye gin lok ma Rwot ociko ki ma ongolo ki i dog Moses bot jo Icrael i lobo aroo me Moab inget kulu Jordan ma okemo Jeriko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>